<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo andiche Yohana, cho chitabu chimwe mu fitabu fitayi fya Lilagano Lipya fyo finsimulila maisa ga Yesu Chilisito. Chila chitabu chimwe mufitabu ifyo fitayi chichemwaga, “Injili” chinya kutijila, “Ndongwa Nofu.” Fitabu ifi fyandikwe hoavaga kufwa Yesu, na Matayo, na Maliko, na Lukasi na Yohana. Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na Yohana tsandikwe na Yohana muwudugo wa mwaka gwa tisini kuhuma kuleleka kwa Chilisito. Nayivaje chitabu chino sinambe chitambule kuta chandikwe na Yohana, lechelelo hila fyo chingilajila kuta hila fyo chandikwe chingihwana nachene na wandisi wa baluva tsa Yohana, na 2 Yohana na 3 Yohana. Vandisi vamwe vakatali vamusimulilaga Yohana kuta ikalaga ku muji gwa Efweso lulavala ulo, ihyo yitselanikaga kuta chitabu chino chandichilwe ku muji gwa Efweso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana antambula bila lufiho chambutso cha kwandika chitabu chino kuta aganaga kuvatanga vanu ili vamutumbe Yesu Chilisito, Mwana va Mulungu yo mumi, 20:31. Ili kwa litumbilo ilyo tunkwanuchila wumi hala ho tungikala kota fyo an'gana Yesu. Chitabu chino vandichilwe Vayawudi na vanu wosi Vayawudi. Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na Yohana sinambe tsihwane hilo na fila fitabu fiyage fidatu. Yohana an'gwadilitsa ndongwa tsa mitinuso jo adisile Yesu, ila mwene siandiche ndongwa tsa mihwano tso alongaga Yesu. Ndongwa tsinji ngomi kota tsila tsa kubatitswa na kujelwa kwa Yesu kula kumbuga, itso tsilimuduhu mu chitabu chino.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tso tsilimugati muchitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana ankwantsa kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu. 1:1-18</para>
  <para style="io">Kahi ankwandika ndongwa tsa mitinuso mitunga jo adisile Yesu. 1:19-12:50</para>
  <para style="io">Hambele ankwandika ndongwa ntsolofu tso tsahumye mu maisa ga Yesu mbaka kufwa na wutsilipuko wake 13:1-20:31</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana ansinda kwa kulonga muchitabu chake mu sula ya 21 anlonga hila Yesu fyo avahumye vanu hala hoavaga kutsilipuka, na muwudugo andiche chambutso cha kwandika chitabu chino.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Lulongwa adisilwe kuva muvili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Iho hawulongolo fing'acha kuwumbwa finu fyeka avaga hoyoli Lulongwa, nayo Lulongwa avaga hamwe na Mulungu, nayo Lulongwa avaga Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Nayo Lulongwa avaga kwa Mulungu, kuhuma fing'acha kuwumbwa finu fyeka. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kukolela kwa mwene uyo Lulongwa Mulungu awumbite finu fyeka, bila mwene kuduhu chinu chochive cho chawumbitwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mugati mwake mwavaga na wumi, nawo uwo wumi wowavaga mwangatsa gwa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Nago mwangatsa gung'alikaga mujitsa, nayo jitsa siyigutsimaga mwangatsa. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Kwavaga na munu yumwe yoatumilwe na Mulungu, litawa lyake achemwaga Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />nayo atsitse kuvalonjela vanu ndongwa tsa uyo mwangatsa, ili kukolela kwa mwene uyo mwangatsa vanu veka vamudichile Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Nayo Yohana siavaga uyo mwangatsa, lechelelo atsitse kuvalonjela vanu ndongwa tsa uyo mwangatsa. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Uyo yo mwangatsa va wukweli, mwangatsa yo ankutsa mu inyi na kuvangatsila vanu veka. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Duve uyo Lulongwa avaga mu inyi, na kwa mwene inyi yawumbitwe, lechelelo vanu sivamutselye. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Atsitse kwa vanu vake, lechelelo vanu vake sivamwidiche. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Lechelelo veka wovamwidiche na kumutumbila, avapelye wuwetso wa kuditwa vana va Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Iwo sivadisilwe vana va Mulungu kwasawuli ya kulelwa na valeli vawo, awu kota fyo an'gana munu, ila valeliche kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Nayo Lulongwa adisilwe muvili, akikalaje hamwe na hetwe. Hetwe natwe tukawuwonaje wumelemo wake, wumelemo kota wa Mwana va wiyeka yo ahumye kwa Dada, amemile wuwuya wa Mulungu na wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana avaga anguvalonjela vanu fikami ndongwa tsa uyo Lulongwa kuta, “Uyu yo yula yo mwanga ntsavalonje kuta mwene uyo ankutsa kumbele kwa heni, na uyo yo muvina kundutila heni, kwasawuli mwanga avaga hata hala heni hontsavaga ntsing'acha kutsa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwasawuli ya wukwilo wake, hetwe tweka twanuche wuwuya wa Mulungu kaha na kaha. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwasawuli malajitso ga Musa galetitwe na Mulungu kukolela kwa Musa, lechelelo wuwuya wa Mulungu na wukweli fyatsitse kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo aliamuwene Mulungu luvala loluve, ila Mwana ng'ani yo alihabehi na Mulungu, nayo uyo amudisile Dada atselaniche.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndogwa tso alontsile Yohana Mubatitsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lukasi 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Itsino tso ndogwa tso alotsile Yohana luvala lula Vayawudi hovavatumile vatawula nambiko na Valavi kuhuma Yelusalemu vamuputse kuta, “Heve yo nani?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana sialemile kuvapitula lechelelo avalonje kuta, “Heni siyo Chilisito Mugombotsi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ihyo vala vanu vakamuputsaje kaha kuta, “Ino lelo heve yo nani? Mbe, heve yo Eliya?” Yohana akavapitulaje, “Heni siyo Eliya.” Vakawilaje kumuputsa, “Mbe, heve yo yula Muloli yo valongaga kuta akutsa?” Yohana akavapitulaje, “Ndaya” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ihyo vakamulonjelaje, “Duve tulonjele heve yo nani? Heve unlonga chichi kwajili yako u mwene? Utulonjele ili tutsele chila cho tukuvapitula vala wo vatutumile.” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana akavapitulaje kota hila Yisaya muloli va Mulungu alontsile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Heni yo litsi lya munu yo alikumbuga kuva mumuditichile chang'ani ng'asi yo akukolela Mutwa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Iwo vanu vavaga vatumilwe na Mafwalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Vakamuputsaje Yohana, “Manyi heve siyo Chilisito, awu siyo Eliya, awu siyo yula Muloli va Mulungu, kwasawuli yachi um'batitsa?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana akavapitulaje kuta, “Heni ntsim'batitsa kwa malenga, lechelelo hagati henyu hoyoli munu yo simumutsele. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Mwene yo an'kutsa hambele hangu, sifuluche nambe kuwopola ndejesi tsa ndatu tsake.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ndogwa itsi tseka tsahumye uko ku Besaniya, mwambu gwa lulenga lwa Yolodani, uko ko abatitsilaga Yohana.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwanang'olo va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Hamilawu yiyage, Yohana akamwonaje Yesu ankutsa akavalonjelaje, yuno yo Mwanang'olo va Mulungu yo akuvahulumila vanu ndongwa ntsibi tsa mu inyi. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Uyuno yo yula yontsavalonje kuta, halutalo hangu ankutsa munu yumwe yo muvina kundutila heni, kwasawuli uyo avaga mwanga hoyoli heni hontsavaga ntsing'ali kuleleka. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nambe heni mwene sintsamutselaga, lechelelo ntsitsitse kubatitsa kwa malenga ili vanu va Isilaheli vamutsele. <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohana akalongaje hila fyo amutselaga Yesu, “Ntsamuwene Muhe va Mulungu ankwika kuhuma Kilanga kwa Mulungu kota ng'unda na kwima mwilanga mwake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Heni sintsamutselaga, lechelelo mwene yo anumile mbatitse vanu kwa malenga avaga andonje kuta, munu yula yo ukumuwona Muhe va Mulungu amwichye kuhuma Kilanga na kikala muchanya mwake, uyo yo akubatitsa vanu kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Heni ntsi mwene ntsaluwene lulongwa luno na ntseliwe kuta uyu yo Mwana va Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vadahitswa valongola va Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Siku ya kavili Yohana avaga hono hahalaga hamwe na vadahitswa vake vavili. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Nayo hoavaga kumuwona Yesu anlutila, akalongaje kuta, “Mulave! Uyuno yo Mwanang'olo va Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Vala vadahitswa vavili hovavaga kumuhulika Yohana anlonga ndongwa itso, vakamufwataje Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu hoavaga kupituka na kuvawona vala vadahitswa vavili vangumufwata, akavaputsaje, “Mun'gana chinu chachi?” Vakamulonjelaje, “Labi,” Chinya kutijila, “Mudahitsi,” ungikala kwiya? <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu akavapitulaje, “Mutse na henye mukuhawona.” Nawo vala vadahitswa vakamufwataje, na vakahawonaje hono ho ikalaga, vakikalaje kuko munyi gula. Nawo vitang'ine na Yesu sakumi ya mumihe. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andeleya mung'olotse va Simoni Petulo, nayo avaga yumwe va vala vadahitswa vavili yo vamuhuliche Yohana fyo alongaga, na kumufwata Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andeleya akamulonjelaje Simoni mung'olotse kuta, “Tumuwene Muhagulwa va Mulungu.” Uyo yo Chilisito.<verse eid="JHN 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Andeleya akamusindikaje Simoni kwa Yesu. Nayo Yesu hoavaga kumulava Simoni akalongaje kuta, “Heve yo Simoni mwana va Yohana. Sambi ukuchemwa Chefwa.” Chijilichi Petulo, chinya kutijila “Litalawe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvachema Fwilipo na Natsanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Siku ya kavili Yesu alamwe kubita ku Galilaya. Kuko amufisile Fwilipo akamulonjelaje, “Ufwate” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Fwilipo avaga munyakaye va muji gwa Betitsayida, muji go vavaga vahumye Andeleya na Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Nayo Fwilipo akamufikaje Natsanaeli, akamulonjelaje, “Tumufisile Yesu mwana va Yusufu va ku Natsaleti, yula yo ndongwa tsake yo tsandikwe mufitabu fya malajitso ga Musa na fya valoli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nayo Natsanaeli akamuputsaje Fwilipo, “Mbe, chinu chinofu chochive chifuluche chihume ku Natsaleti?” Fwilipo akamulonjelaje, “Utse ulole.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Hala Yesu hoavaga kumuwona Natsanaeli ankutsa kwa mwene, akamulonjelaje ndogwa tsake kuta, “Mulave! Yuno yo Muisilaheli va wukweli, nayo alihela wubi wowuve.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nayo Natsanaeli akamuputsaje, “Untselye chinya ndawuli?” Yesu akamujibulaje, ntsakuwene hala howavaga ung'acha wichite hasi ha mubichi gwa mutini, hala Fwilipo hoavaga ang'ali kukuchema. <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natsanaeli akamulonjelaje kuta, “Mudahitsi, heve yo Mwana va Mulungu! Heve yo Muntsajila va Isilaheli!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu akamulonjelaje kuta, “Unumbye kwasawuli ntsikulonje kuta ntsakuwene wichite hasi ha mubichi gwa mutini? Ukutsiwona ndongwa ngomi kulutila itso!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu akaendelea kumwambia Natsanaeli kuta, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta kilanga kukudinduka na henye mukuvawona vatantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu vankwika na kukwina kwajili ya heni Mwana va Munu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Litsenjele ku muji gwa Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Siku ya kadatu kwavaga na lintsenjele ku muji gwa Kana, kumukova gwa Galilaya. Nayo yuve va Yesu avaga kuko, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />nayo Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vavaga valibulitswe mwitsenjele ilyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Difwayi hoyavaga kusila, yuve va Yesu akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Difwayi yisisile!” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu akamupitulaje yuve kuta, “Uleche kundonjela chinu cho ntsin'ganika kudita, luvala lwangu lwa kuludita lulongwa ulo lung'ali kufika.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ihyo yuve va Yesu akavalonjelaje vala vatantsi va hala haliwungo, “Chinu chochive cho akuvalonjela henye muditaje.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Kuko kwavaga na fitsilo sita fya kuvichila malenga fyo fyali fiwuyipwe kwa maganga kwasawuli kukalavila Vayawudi, ili kivika chang'ani kwa kumufugamila Mulungu kwa ntsovelo tsawo, chila chimwe chavaga chifuluche chimeme madebe gahanu ga malenga. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vala vatantsi, “Mufimemye malenga fitsilo ifyo.” Nawo vakafimemyaje malenga fitsilo fila mbaka mwilanga. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Kaha akavalonjelaje, “Lelo muneje mumusindichile muvina va litsenjele.” Ihyo vakanegaje na kumusindichila. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Muvina va liwungo lila avaga kuwontsa malenga akatselaje kuta gagaluche na kuva difwayi. Mwene bila kutsela koyihumye difwayi iyo, ila vala vatantsi wovanetsile malenga gala vatselaga. Muvina va litsenjele akamuchemelaje halubali yula mukweli, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />na akamulonjelaje kuta, “Chila munu alongolaga kuleta difwayi nofu, lechelelo manyi awone vanu vang'weye ndalahela, hawudugo aletaga yila yoyitsolwiche. Lechelelo heve uvisile difwayi nofu mbaka sambi!” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Iyino yo ndajilo ndongola yo adisile Yesu uko ku muji gwa Kana ya Galilaya, akalajilaje wuvetso wake nawo vadahitswa vake vakamutumbaje. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Yesu akikaje hamwe na yuve, na vang'olotse, na vadahitswa vake mbaka ku Kapelinawumu vakikalaje kuko kwa siku nunga.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu am'bita ha Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12">Matayo 21:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Lukasi 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Liwungo lya Pasaka ya Vayawudi holyavaga kuva habehi, ihyo Yesu akakwinaje kubita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Hala ha Nyumba ya Mulungu akavafikaje vanu van'gutsa senga, na ng'olo, na ng'unda, na vanji vavaga vichite mumetsa vanfutsa magobole. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Akabotaje mukotya gwa ndejehe, akavavingaje vabite kivala hamwe na senga ng'ambaku na ng'olo tsawo. Akatsibindulangaje metsa tsawo vala wovabadilasaga magobole ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, na kuboholanga magobole gawo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Akavalonjelaje vala wovagutsaga ng'unda kuta, “Muhetse finu fino hono hano! Muleche kuyidita Nyumba ya Dada vangu kuva hono ha kugutsila finu?” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Vadahitswa vake vakiwukaje kuta yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu hino, “Wugano wa Nyumba yako wukunetsa.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Vayawudi vamwe vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Mbe, ufuluche udite ndajilo yachi yo yikutulajila kuta heve unago mamulaka ga kudita ndogwa tsino?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu akavapitulaje, “Muyigwise Nyumba yino ya Mulungu, na heni nguyitsenga kwa siku tsidatu!” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Vala Vayawudi vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Nyumba yino ya Mulungu yatsentsilwe kwa myaka alubayini na sita. Lechelelo heve unlonga ndawuli kuta ukuyitsenga kwa siku tsidatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Yesu alontsile ihyo siyo kwasawuli ya Nyumba ya Mulungu, ila alongaga kwasawuli ya muvili gwake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Yesu hoavaga kutsilipulwa, vadahitswa vake vakiwukaje kuta mwanga avaga alontsile ndongwa itso, ihyo vakagatumbaje ndongwa tsake na Mandiko ga Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atsitsele numbula tsa vanu veka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu hoavaga ku Yelusalemu kuliwungo lya Pasaka, vanu wolofu hovavaga kutsiwona ndajilo na mitinuso jo aditaga, vakamutumbaje. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Lechelelo Yesu siavahuvye litumbilo lyawo kwa mwene, kwasawuli avatselaga veka hila fyovali munumbula tsawo. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Siyaganikaga vanu vamulonjele Yesu lulongwa loluve lwa munu, kwasawuli atselaga ndongwa tseka tsotsili mu numbula tsa vanu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kwavaga na munu yumwe Mufwalisayo litawa lyake Nikodemu yoavaga yumwe va chilongotsi va Libalatsa lya Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Siku yimwe Nikodemu ahele kwa Yesu hachilo na kumulonjela “Labi, tuntsela kuta heve uli mudahitsi yo utumilwe na Mulungu, kwa kwasawuli kuduhu munu yo afuluche adite ndajilo kota tsino tso un'dita heve manyi Mulungu si alihamwe nayo.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ntsingukulonjela wukweli kuta, manyi munu ave sialeliche lwa kavili si akuvetsa kuwuwona Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu akaputsaje, “Mbe, munu mugogolo akuvetsa chinya ndawuli kuleleka lwa kavili? Mbe, afuluche injile mulileme lya yuve na kuleleka kaha?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu akamupitulaje, “Ntsingukulonjela wukweli kuta, kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche injile mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu, mbaka ave aleliche kwa lulenga na kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Munu alelekaga chimuvili kwa yuve na dade, lechelelo alelekaga chimuhe kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ulekaje kupomoka kwasawuli ngulonje kuta un'ganika kuleleka lwa kavili. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Ng'ala yiwugaga na kubita kokuve ko yin'gana na chibumo chake unguchihulika, lechelelo siufuluche utsele kochinhuma wala kochim'bita. Hohihyo fyo yili kwa chila munu yo aleliche kwa Muhe va Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu akamuputsaje Yesu, “Ndogwa tsino tsifuluche tsive chinya ndawuli?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Heve uli mudahitsi mutambulwa va Isilaheli. Mbe, na heve sinambe utsitsele ndogwa tsino?” <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ntsingukulonjela wukweli kuta, hetwe tunlonga ndongwa tsila tso tunguntsitsela na kulonga tsila tso tutsiwene, lechelelo henye vanu sinambe mutsidichile ndongwa tsila tso tunlonga. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Manyi tsinguvalonjela ndogwa tsa muinyi na henye sinambe munumbile. Mbe, mukuvetsa ndawuli kunumba manyi ntsivalonjele ndogwa tsa Kilanga kwa Mulungu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kuduhu munu yoahele Kilanga kwa Mulungu, ila Mwana va Munu ng'ani yo isile kuhuma Kilanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Kota hila Musa fyo atumbiche kuchanya ntsoka mu mubichi kula kumbuga, hohihyo nayo Mwana va Munu fyo an'ganika kutumbikwa kilanga mu mubichi. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Ili chila munu yo angumutumbila ave na wumi wowugaya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwasawuli iyi Mulungu avaganite vanu va inyi tseka, mbaka akamutawulaje Mwanage va wiyeka, ili chila munu yo angumutumba aleche kuyaga, ila ave na wumi wowugaya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwasawuli Mulungu si amutumile Mwanage mu inyi ili avahije vanu va inyi tseka, ila kukolela kwa mwanage vanu va inyi tseka vakuluswe. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Munu yoyuve yo angumutumbila Mwana siakuhigwa, lechelelo yo sinambe amutumbile Mwana mwanga ahijitwe, kwa kuva siamutumbye Mwana va wiyeka va Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Wuno wo wuhigo kuta Mwangatsa mwanga atsitse kwa vanu va inyi tseka, lechelelo vanu vaganite jitsa kulutila Mwangatsa, kwasawuli ya ng'olwa tsawo ntsibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kwasawuli chila munu yo an'dita ndongwa ntsibi aguvipilaga mwangatsa, kaha sinambe atse ku mwangatsa, ili ndongwa tsake ntsibi tsileche kutselanika. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Lechelelo vala wovaditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu vatsaga ku mwangatsa, ili ndongwa tsawo tsitselaniche finofu kuta tsikoliche kota fyoan'gana Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mubatitsi anlonga ndongwa tsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Yesu na vadahitswa vake vakabitaje ku inyi ya Yudeya, nayo akikalaje kuko na vadahitswa vake kwa luvala lutunga na kubatitsa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana nayo avaga kuko ku Ayinoni habehi na Salimu ambatitsa vanu, kwasawuli kono uko kwavaga na malenga molofu. Vanu volofu vavaga vam'bita kuko na kubatitswa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Luvala ulo Yohana avaga ang'ali kuwopwa mu nyumba ya vawopwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ihyo kukahumilaje sumwano hagati ha vadahitswa va Yohana na Muyawudi yumwe kwajili ya kihofuga kwa ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Vadahitswa vala vakabitaje kwa Yohana na kumulonjela, “Mudahitsi, yula munu yo akalihamwe na heve kumwambu gula gwa lulenga lwa Yolidani, yula yo watulonje ndongwa tsake, sambi am'batitsa vanu, na veka vam'bita kwa mwene!” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana akavapitulaje, “Kuduhu munu yoyuve yoafuluche anuchile chochive, mbaka ave apasile kuhuma Kilanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Henye vene mun'tsela nachene kuta ntsalontsile, heni sintsili Chilisito muhagulwa na Mulungu, ila numilwe ili tsimulongole. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Munya kukwela yo amutolaga mwenga. Lechelelo muyage va munya kukwela imaga habehi nayo na kumuhulikitsa, asangalalaga ndalahela hala hoangulihulika litsi lyake. Kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulu wusangalo wangu wukwilye. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Chilitso Muhagulwa na Mulungu an'ganika kuva muvina ndalahela, na heni ndutilaje kuva ntsi mudodo ndalahela.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa yo ankutsa kuhuma Kilanga kwa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Mwene yo ahagulwe na Mulungu kuhuma Kilanga uyo yo muvina va finu fyeka, na mwene yo ali muinyi yo va mu inyi, nayo alongaga ndongwa tsa muinyi. Lechelelo yo ahagulwe na Mulungu kuhuma Kilanga uyo yo muvina va finu fyeka. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Mwene yo alongaga fila fyo afiwene na kufihulika, lechelelo kuduhu munu yo angutsitumba ndongwa tsake. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Munu yoyuve yo angutsidichila ndongwa tsake, alajilaga kuta Mulungu yo va wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Munu yula yo atumilwe na Mulungu alongaga ndongwa tsa Mulungu, kwakuva Mulungu amutawulaga Muhe vake kwa wukwilo weka. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Dada angumugana Mwanage, nayo amupelye wuvetso wa kudita chila chinu. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Munu yoyuve yo angumutumba Mwana uyo ana wumi wowugaya wudugo, lechelelo munu yula yo sinambe amuhulikitse Mwana si akuva na wumi wo wugaya wudugo, ila Mulungu akumuvipila.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anlongana na mudala Musamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafwalisayo vakahulikaje kuta Yesu avaga avadisile vanu wolofu kuva vadahitswa na kuvabatitsa kulutila Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Yesu mwene siavabatitsaga, ila vadahitswa vake wo vabatitsaga. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Ihyo Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, akawukaje ku inyi ya Yudeya akawuyaje kanji ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Luvala ulu aganikaga akolele hagati ha Samaliya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Akafikaje ha muji gumwe gwa Samaliya gogunchemwa Sikali, habehi na gula mugunda go Yakobo amupelye Yusufu mwanage. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Hono iho havaga na chisima cha Yakobo, nayo Yesu avaga ichite hala kwasawuli avaga afuluje kwa lujendo, akatambalitsaje halubali ha chisima. Yavaga kota sa sita ya hamunyi. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Akatsaje mudala yumwe va inyi ya Samaliya kudeha malenga, na Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ntsisuka malenga ntsing'we.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Luvala ulo vadahitswa vake vavaga vahele ku mujini kugula filyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mudala yula akamupitulaje, “Heve uli Muyawudi na heni ntsili mu Samaliya! Yiveye ndawuli heve unsuka kwa heni malenga ga kung'wa?” Vayawudi si vitangaga kwa chinu chochive na hetwe Vasamaliya. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu akamupitulaje, “Manyi ukautsele fifunje fyo atawulaga Mulungu, nayo yo nani yo angukusuka, umele malenga ntsing'we. Ukakumusuka mwene nayo akakukupela malenga ganya wumi wo wugaya wudugo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yula mu mudala akamupitulaje, Mutwa, heve ulihela chinejelo cha malenga na chisima chino chitali, ukupata kwiya malenga ganya wumi wo wugaya wudugo? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Mbe, heve uli muvina kulutila dada vetu Yakobo, yo atupelye hetwe chisima chino, na mwene hamwe na vanage na fidimwa fyake vang'waga malenga gano? <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu akamupitulaje, “Chila yo akung'wa malenga gano akuwona ng'alu kanji, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />lechelelo vanu veka yo akung'wa malenga go ngumupela heni si akuwona ng'alu kanji. Malenga go ngumupela gakuva ntsasa ya wumi wowugaya wudugo mugati mwawo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Yula mudala akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Mutwa ntsisuka umele malenga igo ili ndeche kuwona ng'alu kanji, na ndekaje kutsa hano kunega malenga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu akamulonjelaje yula mudala, “Ubite ukamucheme mulume vako, mutsase hano.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Yula mudala akamupitulaje, “Heni ntsilihela mulume,” Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ulontsile wukweli kuta ulihela mulume. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwasawuli mwanga uka utoliche na valume vahanu, nayo yo mungikalasa sambi uyo nayo siyo mulume vako, ihyo ulontsile wukweli.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yula mudala akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Mutwa, ntsin'wona heve uli muloli va Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Vakukwetu Vasamaliya vafugamaga mu chidunda chino, lechelelo henye Vayawudi mulongaga kuta tun'ganika tukafugame uko ku Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Heve yuva un'ganika unumbile, kuna luvala lo lukutsa henye simukuganika kumusuka Dada mu chidunda chino awu kula ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Henye Vasamaliya munfugamila chinu cho simuchitsele, lechelelo hetwe Vayawudi tungumufugamila Mulungu yo tumutsele, kwasawuli wukuluso wunhuma kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Lechelelo luvala lunkutsa, nalo mwanga lufisile na vanu vakweli, na wo vakumufugamila Mulungu kwa kulongontswa na Muhe va Mulungu na wukweli. Kwasawuli vanu wo vangumufugamila chinya hino wo iwo Dada yo anguvagana. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mulungu yo Muhe, na vala ng'ani wo vangumufugamila, iwo van'ganika kumufugamila kwa Muhe va Mulungu na wukweli.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Yula mudala akamupitulaje Yesu, “Ntsitsela kuta Masiya yo anchemwa Chilisito, an'kutsa. Manyi atse akutulonjela ndogwa tseka.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Heni yo ntsinlonga na heve, yo heni.” <verse eid="JHN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Luvala ulo vadahitswa vake vakawuyaje, vakatinukaje ndalahela kumuwona an'longana na yula mudala. Lechelelo kuduhu yo amuputsitse, “Un'gana chichi kwake?” Awu “Kwasawuli yachi un'longana nayo?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ihyo mudala yula akachilekaje chitsilo chake, na akawuyaje ku mujini na kuvalonjela vanu kuta, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mutse tubite mukamulole munu yo andonje chila chinu cho ntsadisile! Mbe, si yifuluche uyu ave yo Chilisito?”<verse eid="JHN 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ihyo vanu vakawukaje kuhuma ku mujini, na kubita koali Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Luvala ulo vadahitswa vake vavaga vangumugongoletsa Yesu kuta, “Mudahitsi ulye nambe chochive!” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Lechelelo Yesu akavapitulaje, “Heni ntsinacho chilyo cho simuchitsele henye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Vadahitswa vake vakiputsaje vene kwa vene, “Mbe, kuna munu yo amuletye chilyo?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Chilyo changu cho ichi, ntsin'ganika kudita choan'gana yula yo anumile na kukwitsa kantsi yake. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Henye simulongaga kuta, jisije myentsi jitayi duve kufika luvala lwa kubeta! Lechelelo mulave hila filyo fya kumigunda fili chang'ani kwa kubetwa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mubetaji akwanuchila wuhombo wake nayo ankong'asaga filyo kwasawuli ya wumi wugaya wudugo, ili munu yo apandite na yo am'beta veka vahechelele hohamwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Hoihyo lulongwa lwa kuta, yumwe apandaga na yunji abetaga, lulongwa ulo lwa wukweli vaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Heni ntsivatumile mukabete filyo fyo simupandite, vamwe vadisile kantsi nalamu, lechelelo henye mufwahilwe kukolela kantsi ntsawo nalamu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Vasamaliya wolofu kuhuma ku muji gula vamutumbye Yesu kwasawuli ya ndogwa tso alontsile yula mudala yo alontsile kuta, “Andonje ndogwa tseka ntsontsadisile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ihyo Vasamaliya vakabitaje kwa Yesu vaka musukaje ikale navo, nayo akikaleje kuko siku tsivili. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Vanu wolofu ndalahela vakamutumbaje Yesu kwasawuli ya lulogwa ulo. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Vanu vakamulonjelaje yula mudala kuta, “Hetwe tuntumba siyo kwasawuli ya ndogwa tsako hela, ila hetwe tuvene tuhuliche na tuntsela nachene kuta yuno yo mukulusi va inyi tseka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponentsa mwana va muvina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Hotsaveye kulutila siku tsivili Yesu akawukaje hono iho na kubita ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kwasawuli Yesu mwene alontsile kuta, muloli va mulungu siahesimilwaga mu inyi yake mwene. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Hoavaga kufika ku Galilaya, na Vagalilaya vamulibulitse, kwasawuli nawo vavaga ku Liwungo lya Pasaka, na vatsiwene ndongwa tseka tso adisile Yesu kuko ku Yelusalemu luvala lwa Liwungo ilyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kaha Yesu akapilukaje ku muji gwa Kana ya ku Galilaya, kula ko adisile malenga gave difwayi. Kwavaga na chilongotsi yumwe yo ali na mwana mutamwa uko ku Kapelinawumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Chilongotsi uyo avaga kuhulika kuta Yesu ali awusile ku Galilaya kuhuma ku Yudeya, akabitaje na kumusuka abite akamuponetse mwanage yo ali mutamwa tabani. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu akalongaje, “Heve manyi uleche kutsiwona ndajilo na mitinuso siukutumba ndaya!” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yula chilongotsi akamulonjelaje, “Muvina dedede tubite mwanangu ho ang'acha ang'ali kutajika” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ubite hela, mwanago aponile!” Yula chilongotsi akatsitumbaje ndongwa ntsila ntsa Yesu, akawukaje. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Hoavaga ang'ali mungasi, vatantsi vake vakitang'anaje nayo na kumulonjela kuta mwanago aponile. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nayo akavaputsaje luvala lo antsitse kuva mumi, nawo vakamulonjelaje “Higolo saa saba hamunyi iho ho akaponile wutamwa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Yula dada va yula mwana akiwukaje kuta lo luvala lululaga lo amulonje Yesu kuta, “Ubite mwanago akuva mumi!” Kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, mwene na vanu veka va mukaye yake vakamutumbilaje Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Iyi yo ndajilo ya kavili yo adisile Yesu hoavaga kuwuya Kugalilaya kuhuma ku Yudeya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa chiteve Siku ya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso kwavaga na Liwungo lya Vayawudi ku Yelusalemu, nayo Yesu akabitaje. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Kuko Yelusalemu habehi na lwitsi lwa ng'olo kwavaga na litsimbwi lya malenga lyo lyachemwaga kwa Chiebulaniya Betitsata, lyo lyavaga lipilimwe na fyumba fihanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Iho ha fyumba ifyo havaga na vanu wolofu vatamwa, na fibofu, na fiteve, na wovapotsile filungo fyawo, vatsindilaga malenga gatigulwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kwasawuli kwavaga na luvala ikaga mutantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu na kutigula malenga, na munu yoyuve yo akulongola kwinjila mu malenga gala hala ho gatiguche, aponaga wutamwa wowuve wo avaga nawo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Kuko kwavaga na munu yumwe yo avaga mutamwa kwa luvala lwa myaka salasini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu avaga kumuwona mutamwa yula avasise hala na kuno atselaga kuta aveye hala kwa luvala lweka ulo, akamuputsaje, “Mbe, un'gana uve mumi?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Yula mutamwa akamupitulaje Yesu kuta, “Muvina, heni ntsilihela munu vakusindika mu malenga hala ho gantigulwa, chila hontsigana kwinjila munu yunji andongola.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Winuche utole lusaga lwako ujende!” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Bahobaho munu uyo akaponaje na kutegula lusaga lwake na kwantsa kujenda. Lulongwa ulo lwadisilwe Siku ya Kwesela. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Kwasawuli iyo Vayawudi vamwinga vakamulonjelaje yula munu yo aponitswe kuta, “Munyi guno Siku ya Kwesela, sinambe yiganiche heve kitwika lusaga lwako.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Lechelelo mwene akalongaje, “Yula munu yo amonitse andonje kuta tole lusaga lwako ujende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nawo vakamuputsaje, “Uyo munu yo akulonje, tole lusaga lwako ujende, yo nani?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Lechelelo mwene yula yo aponitswe avaga siamutsele munu yula yo amuponitse, kwasawuli Yesu avaga mwanga awusile hono hala na kihantsa na vanu wolofu. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Hambele Yesu akamufikaje munu yula yo amuponitse mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, na akamulonjelaje kuta, “Lelo mwanga uponile ulekaje kupiluchila kudita ndongwa ntsibi, na manyi udite ihyo lukukupata lulongwa lukomi kuliko ulo.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Munu uyo akabitaje kuvalonjela filongotsi va Vayawudi kuta Yesu yo amuponitse. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo Vayawudi vakantsaje kumudesa Yesu kwasawuli aditaga ndongwa kota itso Siku ya Kwesela. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu akavalonjelaje “Dada vangu ankola katsi mbaka sambi, na heni ntsinkola katsi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwasawuli ya ndongwa itso filongotsi va Vayawudi vakavipaje na kugana kumukopola Yesu. Siyo kwasawuli ya kudita finu yo sinambe figaniche Siku ya Kwesela ng'ani, ila anlonga kuta Mulungu yo Dada vake, na kuta mwene alisava na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamulaka ga Mwana va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, Mwana si afuluche adite chinu chochive aliyena, mwene aditaga chila cho angumuwona Dade anguchidita. Kwakuva cho anguchidita Dada nayo Mwana achiditaga hihilaga. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Dada angumugana Mwana na kumulajila chila chinu cho anguchidita mwene, kaha akumulajila ndongwa ngomi kulutila itso ili henye mupomoche. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kota hila Dada fyo avatsilipulaga vanu na kuvapela wumi, ho hihyo nayo Mwana anguvapela wumi vala wo anguvagana. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Dada si amuhigaga munu yoyuve, lechelelo mamulaka geka ga kuhiga amulechye Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ili vanu veka vamuhesimile Mwana kota hila fyo vangumuhesimila Dada. Munu yoyuve yo sinambe amuhesimile Mwana uyo sinambe amuhesimile Dada yo amutumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Ntsinguvalojela wukweli kuta munu yoyuve yo anhulika lulongwa lwangu na kumutumbila yula yo anumile, anawo wumi wo wugaya wudugo. Nayo siakuhigwa, ila akuva alutye ku chifo na kwinjila ku wumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta luvala lunkutsa, na kaha mwanga lufisile, ihyo vanu yo vafweye vakuhulika litsi lya Mwana va Mulungu, nawo yo vakulihulika vakuva wumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kota hila Dada fyo ali mwantso gwa wumi, hihyo nayo Mwana fyo ali mwantso gwa wumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kaha Dada amupelye mamulaka ga kuhiga kwasawuli mwene yo Munu yo atumilwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mulekaje kutinuka ho munhulika lulongwa ulu, kwasawuli kuna luvala lunkutsa, vanu vala yovali mu makabuli vakuhulika litsi lyake. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Nawo veka vakutsilipulwa, na vala yo vaditaga ndongwa kota fyo an'gana Mulungu vakuva na wumi wo wugaya wudugo, na vala yo vaditaga ndongwa ntsibi kwa Mulungu vakuhigwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu yo vangutsivikula ndongwa tsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Heni sifuluche ndite lulongwa loluve kwa wuvetso wangu ntsimwene. Ila heni nyigaga kota fyontsihulika kuhuma kwa Dada, nayo nyigo yangu ya wutsamu. Kwasawuli heni sinambe ndite hila fyo ntsin'gana heni, ila nditaga kota fyo an'gana yula yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Manyi ntsilonjele ntsimwene, ndonga yangu siyikidikitswa kuva ya wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Lechelelo koyoli yunji yo alongaga ndongwa tsa heni, na heni ntsin'tsela kuta ndongwa tseka tso anlonga kwa heni itso tsa wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Henye mwatumile vanu kwa Yohana, nayo avalonje wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Heni sintsihuvilaga vanu valonje ndongwa tsangu, lechelelo ntsinlonga ndongwa itsi ili henye mupate wukuluso. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana avaga kota tala yo yinkwaka na kwangatsa, na henye mwanga muka chang'ani kuhechelela na mwangatsa gwake kwa luvala ludodo hela. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Lechelelo heni ntsina wusahidi wukomi ndalahela kulutila wula wa Yohana. Kwa kuva katsi tsila tso ntsin'dita tso anumile Dada ntsitsidite, na ihyo tsinguvalajila kuta Dada yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Nayo Dada yoanumile yo alongaga ndongwa tsangu. Henye simwalihuliche litsi lyake, na kumuwona fyoali, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na henye sinambe mutsitumbe ndongwa tso anlonga, kwasawuli sinambe mumutumbe yula yo amutumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Henye mugahimaga Mandiko ga Mulungu, mutijilaga kuta gakuvalonjela hila fyo mukuwupata wumi wo wugaya wudugo, lechelelo sinambe mutsele kuta Mandiko gago ganlonga ndongwa tsa heni. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Nambe ihyo mulema kutsa kwa heni ili mupate wumi wo wugaya wudugo.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Heni sintsanuchilaga ntsumitso kuhuma kwa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Lechelelo ntsinguvatsela kuta henye mulihela wugano wa Mulungu munumbula tsenyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Heni ntsitsitse kwa mamulaka ga Dada vangu, na henye si mwantsanuche, lechelelo munu yunji manyi atse kwa mamulaka gake uyo mukumwanuchila. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mufuluche ndawuli kunumba heni, na kuno mun'gana kitsumila henye kwa henye, kuno munlema kusaka wutsumitso wo wunhuma kwa Mulungu ng'ani? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Lechelelo mulekaje kuhotsa kuta heni nguvahiga halutalo ha Dada vangu, Musa yo mumudisile ave lihuvilo lyenyu, uyo yo akuvasongeletsa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Mukamuve mungumutumba Musa, mukakunumba na heni, kwasawuli Musa andiche ndongwa tsangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Lechelelo manyi simukatsitumbye ndongwa tso andiche Musa, mukutsitumba ndawuli ndongwa tso ntsinlonga?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvapela filyo vanu elufu tsihanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lukasi 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Tsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Yesu akabitaje mwambu gwa Bahali ya Galilaya, kwa litawa linji yachemwaga Bahali ya Tibeliya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Lilugu lya vanu lyamufwataga kwasawuli vavaga vatsiwene ndajilo ntsolofu tso avaga avaditye vatamwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Kaha Yesu akakwinaje kuchidunda, akikalaje kuko hamwe na vadahitswa vake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Liwungo lya Pasaka ya Vayawudi lyavaga habehi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu hoavaga kuvawona lilugu lya vanu linkutsa kwake, akamulonjelaje Fwilipo, “Tukugula kwiya mabumunda ili vanu vano valye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu amuputsitse ihyo ili amujele Fwilipo, kwasawuli mwene atselaga cho akudita. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Fwilipo akamupitulaje, “Nambe tuka tuve na magobole bwelele, sigafuluche gakwile kugula filyo fya kuvakwila vanu vano veka.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mudahitswa vake yumwe yo achemwaga Andeleya, yoavaga mung'olotse na Simoni Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Hano tunayo mukwamitsi ana mabumunda gahanu ga sayili na somba tsivili. Lechelelo sigakukwila kwa vanu vano veka.” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu akalongaje, “Muvalonjele vanu vikalise hasi.” Hono hala havaga na misoli mifupi. Nawo vanu vakikalisaje, valume vavaga elufu tsihanu. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Ihyo Yesu akategulaje mabumunda gala, akamulumbaje Mulungu na kuvagavasila vanu wovavaga vichite hono hala mbaka vakakwilaje, na hihila akavagavilaje na somba tsila, chila munu kota fyo akiguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Vanu veka vavaga kulya na kiguta, akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Mutole fipande fya mabumunda fyo fisije ili fileche kuyaga nambe chimwe.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ihyo vakakong'asaje fila fipande fyeka fyofisije na kumemetsa fitangula kumi na fivili kuhuma mu fipande fila fihanu na somba tsivili. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Vanu vavaga kuyiwona iyo ndajilo yo adisile Yesu, vakantsaje kulonga kuta, “Nachene uyuno yo Muloli va Mulungu yo akutsa mu inyi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu hoavaga kutsela kuta vanu van'gana vatse vamuviche kwa ludali ili ave muntsajila vawo, akibagulaje na kubita kahi kuchidunda aliyena.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'jenda mwilanga mululenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Holyavaga kusota litsuva, vadahitswa vake vakikaje na kubita kulilamba, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />vakakwinaje mu mutumbwi vakantsaje kulowoka mubahali kubita Kapelinawumu. Luvala ulo mwanga kwavaga na jitsa, na Yesu avaga ang'ali kufika. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Lilamba likatigukaje kwasawuli kwavaga na ng'ala ngomi yo yawugaga. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Vadahitswa hovavaga vahele lujendo lwa kota chilomita tsihanu awu sita hino, vakamuwonaje Yesu an'jenda mwilanga mululenga alibehi na kufika hamutumbwi, na ihyo vakogopaje. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muleche kuva na muloto. Yo heni!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ihyo vakalamulaje injile mu mutumbwi, na simusika mutumbwi gukafikaje kuinyi ng'afu kovabitaga.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vangumusaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Siku ya kavili lila lilugu lya vanu wovavaga vasije mwambu gwa kavili gwa lilamba, vakatselaje kuta hono iho gusije mutumbwi gumwe hela! Nawo vakatselaje kuta na Yesu siavaga ahele hamwe na vadahitswa vake, kwasawuli vadahitswa vake vavaga vahele valiyena. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Lechelelo jikatsaje mitumbwi jinji kuhuma ku Tibeliya jikafikaje habehi na hala hovalyeye mabumunda, hono hala Yesu ho avaga kumulumba Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ihyo lilugu lila lya vanu holyavaga kutsela kuta Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake valihaduhu, vakakwinaje mu mitumbwi ijo vakabitaje ku Kapelanawumu kumusaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yo Libumunda lyo linleta Wumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Vala vanu hovavaga kumuwona Yesu mwambu gula gwa kavili vakamuputsaje, “Bee, Mudahitsi! Ufisile hanili kuno?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu akavapitulaje kuta, ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta henye munsaka heni siyo kwasawuli mwawene ndajilo yila, ila kwasawuli mwalyeye mabumunda gala na kiguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mulekaje kuchigatsichila chilyo cho chiwolaga, ila muchigatsichilaje chilyo chila cho sichiwolaga mbaka ku wumi wo wugaya wudugo, chilyo cho akuvapela Mwana va Munu yo idichilwe na Dada yo Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ihyo vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Tun'ganika tudite ndawuli ili tuyikole katsi ya Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu akavapitulaje, “Katsi ya Mulungu yo yino, mumutumbe mwene yo atumilwe na Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ihyo vanu vala vakamuputsaje, “Ukutuditila ndajilo yachi ili tuyiwone na kukutumba? Mbe, ukudita lulongwa lwachi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Vakukwetu valyeye chilyo cho chinchemwa mana kula kumbuga, kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, avapelye chilyo cho chinhuma Kilanga ili valye.”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, siyo Musa yo avapelye mabumunda kuhuma Kilanga, ila Dada vangu yo anguvapela henye mabumunda ga kweli kuhuma Kilanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwasawuli libumunda lya Mulungu yo yula yo ankwika kuhuma Kilanga na kuvapela wumi vanu va mu inyi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mutwa, kuhuma sambi utupele libumunda ilyo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, heni yo libumunda lya wumi. Mwene yo ankutsa kwa heni si akuwona ntsala, nayo yo an'numba heni si akuwona ng'alu. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Lechelelo kota fyo ntsavalonje henye kuta na muvaje mumbwene, ila sinambe munumbe. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Vanu vala veka yo akumela Dada vakuva vafwasi vangu, na yoyuve yo ankutsa kwangu singujela kumulema. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kwakuva sintsisile kuhuma Kilanga ili kudita cho ntsin'gana heni, ila kudita cho an'gana mwene yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Chila cho an'gana yula yo anumile cho ichino kuta, vala vanu veka wo amelye ndekaje kumuyatsa nambe yumwe, ila ntsivatsilipule veka ha siku ya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwakuva chinu chikomi cho anguchigana Dada vangu cho ichi, chila munu yo angumulola na kumutumba Mwana ave na wumi wo wugaya wudugo, na heni nguvatsilipula ha siku ya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ihyo Vayawudi vakantsaje kukalala kwasawuli Yesu alontsile kuta, “Heni yo ntsili libumunda kuhuma Kilanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Vakavaje vanlonga kuta mbe! Uyuno si Yesu Mwana va Yosefu ndaa! Yuve na dade situvatsele ndaa? Yiveye ndawuli anlonga kuta ntisile kuhuma Kilanga? <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mulekaje kikalalila henye kwa henye. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kuduhu munu yo afuluche atse kwa heni, manyi ave siakwetsilwe na Dada yo anumile, na munu uyo heni ngumutsilipula ha siku ya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Valoli va Mulungu vandiche kuta, vanu veka vakudahitswa na Dada. Munu yoyuve yo akumuhulikitsa Dada na kutsela hila fyo an'dahitsa, uyo atsaga kwa heni. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Kuduhu munu yo yuve yamuwene Dada, ila munu yula yoahumye kwa Mulungu, uyo yo amuwene Dada. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, yo an'numba heni uyo anawo wumi wo wugaya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Heni yo libumunda lya wumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Vakukwenyu valyeye chilyo cho chinchemwa mana kumbuga, na vakafwaje. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Lechelelo ihano hana libumunda lyo lihumye Kilanga, ili chila munu yoyuve yo akulya aleche kufwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Heni yo ntsili libumunda lyo linya wumi lyo lihumye Kilanga. Munu yoyuve yo akulya libumunda ili akikala bila wudugo. Libumunda lyo ntsinguvapela go muvili gwangu, go ntsingugutawula kwajili ya wumi wa vanu veka va mu inyi tseka.” <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Vayawudi vakantsaje kulongana vene kwa vene, “Munu yuno akuvetsa ndawuli kutupela hetwe muvili gwake ili tulye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, manyi muleche kulya muvili gwa Mwana va Munu na kung'wa danda yake, simukuva na wumi mugati mwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Chila munu yo ankulya muvili gwangu na kung'wa danda yangu, uyo anawo wumi wo wugaya wudugo, na heni ngumutsilipula siku ya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwasawuli muvili gwangu cho chilyo cha wukweli, na danda yangu yo chinu cha kung'wa cha wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Munu yo ankulya muvili gwangu na kung'wa danda yangu, akikala mugati mwangu na heni ngikala mugati mwake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Kota hila Dada yo mumi fyo anumile, na heni ntsi mumi kukolela kwa mwene, hohihyo munu yo akuntsilya akuva mumi kukolela kwa heni. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ili lyo libumunda lyolisile kuhuma Kilanga, siyo kota mana yila yo valyeye vakukwenyu na hambele vakafwaje. Munu yo akulya libumunda ili akuva na wumi wo wugaya wudugo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu alontsile ndongwa intso hala ho avadahitsaga umo mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi uko ku Kapelinawumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsotsinleta Wumi wo wugaya Wudugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ihyo vafwasi wolofu va Yesu hovavaga kuhulika ihyo vakalongaje, “Ndongwa itsi nalamu hilo! Nani yo afuluche kutsihulukitsa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu akatselaje mu numbula yake kuta vafwasi vake vakale kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, ihyo akavaputsaje, “Mbe, lulongwa ulu luvadisile mukalale? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Lelo yikuva ndawuli, ho mukumuwona Mwana va Munu ho akuva am'bita Kilanga uko koavaga iho hamutalo? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Muhe va Mulungu yo atawulaga wumi, muvili sigufwayaga chinu. Ndongwa itsi tso ntsivalonje go Muhe kaha tso wumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Hamwe na ihyo kovali vanu hagati henyu yo valihela litumbilo.” Yesu alontsile ihyo kwakuva antselaga kuhuma hamutalo kuta vanani wo sinambe vamutumbe, nayo atselaga kuta nani yo akumupituka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kaha akavalonjelaje, kwasawuli ya iyo ntsavalonje kuta kuduhu munu yo akuventsa kutsa kwa heni manyi aleche kuchemwa na Dada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kwasawuli ya ndongwa itso vafwasi vanji wolofu vapilwiche kumbele, vakamulekaje. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu akavaputsaje vala vadahitswa kumi na vavili kuta Mbe, na henye mun'gana kuwuka? <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petulo akamupitulaje, “Mutwa Yesu, tuwuche tubite kwa nani? Heve unatso ndogwa ntsa wumi wo wugaya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Hetwe tun'tumba, na kaha tutselite kuta heve yo Muhagulwa va Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, singavahagwe henye kumi na vavili? Nambe ihyo yumwe venyu yo Lihoka!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu alontsile ihyo kwasawuli ya Yuda mwana va Simoni Isikaliote. Uyo yo akumupituka, nambe avaga muyawo va vadahitswa vala kumi na vavili.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu sinambe atumbilwe na vang'olotse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa intso, Yesu ajendelaga hono hanji hanji na kukola katsi ku Galilaya. Siaganaga kubita ku Yudeya kwasawuli vavina va Vayahudi vaganaga kumukopola. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Nalyo Liwungo lya Fyuwo fya Vayawudi, lya kwiwuka hila fyo vahamaga hamaga kubalali lyavaga habehi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />ihyo vang'olotse va Yesu vakamulonjelaje, “Uwuche iha ubite ku Yudeya ili vadahitswa vako vatsele na kutsiwona ndajilo tso un'dita. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Munu yoaganaga kuva mutambulwa, siaditaga ndongwa tsake kwa lufiho. Manyi un'dita ndongwa itsi wilajile umwene halutalo ha vanu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Kwakuva nambe vang'olotse va Yesu siva mutumbye. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, luvala lwangu silulafika, lechelelo luvala lwenyu hololi siku ntseka. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Vanu va muinyi sivafuluche vavavipile henye, lechelelo vam'mbipila heni kwasawuli ntsinguvalonjela kuta ndongwa tsovan'dita ntsibi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Henye mubite ku Liwungo ilyo, lechelelo heni singubita kwasawuli luvala lwangu lung'ali kufika. <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesu aveye kulonga ndongwa itso, akasigalaje ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ku Liwungo lya Fyuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Vang'olotse hovavaga kuwuka kubita ku Liwungo ilyo, Yesu nayo akabitaje kuko, lechelelo ahele kwa kifiha. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Kwakuva vavina va Vayawudi vavaga vangumusaka ku Liwungo ilyo, nawo vakiputsaje kuta, “Alikwiya munu yula?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kwavaga na mwepelemwepele tsitagalye hala ha lilugu lya vanu yo valonganaga ndongwa tsa Yesu. Vamwe valongaga kuta, “Munu uyu muwuya.” Vamwe valongaga kuta “Ndaya be! Anguvayatsa vanu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Lechelelo kuduhu munu yo ajetsitse kulonga fikami ndongwa itso kwasawuli vanu vawogopaga vavina va Vayawudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ihyo hoyavaga kufika hagatinanagati ya Liwungo, Yesu akakwinaje na kwinjila ha Nyumba ya Mulungu na kwantsa kudahitsa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Vayawudi vakatinukaje ndalahela na kulonga kuta, munu yuno apatite kwiya ntselo tsa kudahitsa vanu bila mwene kudahitswa? <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Ihyo Yesu akavapitulaje, “Madahitso go ntsinguvadahitsa sigaheni ndaya, lechelelo gayula yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Manyi munu yoyuve an'dita madahitso gala goan'gana Mulungu, akutsela kuta madahitso iga si gangu ila gahumye kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Munu yo alongaga kwasawuli yake mwene, ansaka wumelemo wake mwene, lechelelo yo asakaga wumelemo wa yula yoamutumile, uyo munu muwuya na mugati mwake muduhu wubi wowuve. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mbe, Musa siavapelye malajitso ndaa? Lechelelo kuduhu nambe munu yumwe hagati henyu yo angugafwata malajitso igo. Kwasawuli ya chichi mun'gana kung'opola?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Lilugu lyeka lya vanu likamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Heve una lisoka! Mbe, nani yo an'gana akukopole?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, ngadisile ndajilo yimwe hela na henye nyeka mukatinukaje. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa avalajitse muvingitse vana venyu likumbi. Lechelelo si gahumye kwa Musa ila kwa vakukwenyu, na henye munkwingitsa vana likumbi nambe yivaje Siku ya Kwesela. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Manyi yive munu ingitswaga likumbi nambe Siku ya Kwesela ili malajitso ga Musa galeche kubedalwa, mbona lelo mum'mbipila heni kwasawuli ntsimuponitse munu Siku ya Kwesela? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mulekaje kuhiga ndongwa kwa kulola hela, lechelelo muhigaje ndongwa kwa wuwuya.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbe, uyu yo Chilisto?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Vanu vamwe va ku Yelusalemu vakalongaje “Mbe, yuno siyo munu yo vangumusaka vavina van'gana vamukopola ndaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mulole lelo! Alihano na angilajila helu hela, kuduhu munu yo angumulonjela lulongwa loluve! Mbe, yikuva iva vavina vanguwutsela wukweli kuta uyu yo Chilisto? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Chilisto hoakutsa kuduhu munu yoyuve yo akutsela koahumye, lechelelo yuno tun'tsela koahumye.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu akendelelaje kudahitsa ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, akalongaje fikami kuta, “Heni muntsele na konyumye mukutsele, ila sintsitsitse ntsimwene, na mwene yo anumile heni yo va wukweli na henye simumutsele. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Lechelelo heni ntsimutsele kwasawuli ntsahumye kwa mwene, nayo mwene yo anumile heni.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ihyo vanu vakaganaje kumubata, lechelelo kuduhu munu yoyuve yavetsitse kumubata kwasawuli luvala lwake lwa kibatika lwavaga lung'ali kufika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Vanu wolofu wovali vakong'ine vakamutumbaje Yesu, nawo valongaga kuta, Mbe, hoakuva kutsa Chilisito akudita ndajilo ntsolofu kulutila itsi tso an'dita munu yuno?<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamilitsi Vantumwa vakamubate Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafwalisayo vahuliche vanu vampwepapwepa ndongwa tsa Yesu, ihyo vavina va vatawula nambiko hamwe na Mafwalisayo vakavatumaje vamilintsi vabite vakamubate Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu akalongaje, “Ngikala na henye kwa luvala ludodo, na kaha ngupiluka kwa yula yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mukusaka, lechelelo simukumbona, na hono hala hontsili henye simufuluche mufiche.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Vavina va Vayawudi vakalonganaje kuta, “Mwene munu yuno akubita kwiya ko situfuluche hetwe kubita? Mbe, an'gana kubita kwa Vayawudi yovangikala kwa Vajilichi na kuvadahitsa Vajilichi? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mbe, lulongwa lwachi lwene luno lo atulonje kuta, mukusaka na lechelelo simukumbona, na hono hala hontsili henye simufuluche mufiche?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntsasa tsa Malenga ga Wumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Siku ya wudugo ya Liwungo ilyo likomi, Yesu akimaje na kulonga kwa litsi likomi kuta, manyi kuna munu yoyuve yo munya ng'alu atse kwangu ang'wee! <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Kota fyo ganlonga Mandiko ga Mulungu, “Munu yoyuve yo anumbila heni ntsasa tsa malenga ga wumi tsikutsililika munumbula yake!” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu alontsile ndongwa itso kwasawuli ya Muhe va Mulungu yo vakumwanuchila hambele vanu veka wo vakumutumbila, Muhe va Mulungu avaga ang'ali kutsa kwasawuli Yesu avaga ang'acha kutsumitswa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vantelana kwasawuli ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Vanu vamwe hagati ha lilugu lila hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso vakalongaje, “Wukweli munu yuno yo yula Muloli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Vamwe vakalongaje, “Uyu yo Chilisito!” Lechelelo vamwe vakalongaje, “Mbe, Chilisito afuluche ahume ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Mbe, Mandiko ga Mulungu sigalongaga kuta Chilisito akuhuma ku lukolo lwa Dawudi, na akuleleka ku Betelehemu, muji gwa Dawudi ndaa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ihyo vanu vala vakatelanaje kwasawuli ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Vanu vamwe vaganaga kumubata lechelelo kuduhu nambe munu yumwe yo ajetsitse kumubata.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vavina va Vayawudi vanlema kumutumba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ihyo vala vimilitsi vakapilukaje kwa vavina va vatawula nambiko na Mafwalisayo. Nawo vakavaputsaje kwasawuli yachi simumubatite Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Vala vimilitsi vakavapitulaje, “Kuduhu munu yo afuluche alonje kota fyo anlonga munu yula!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafwalisayo vakavaputsaje kuta, “Mbe, na henye mwanga mudetelitswe? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Mbe, mwanga mwamuwene nambe muvina yumwe, awu yumwe va Mafwalisayo yo amutumbye? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Lechelelo lilugu lya vanu wo sinambe vagatsele malajitso ga Musa, iwo wo vakotulwe na Mulungu kuno sivagatsele malajitso ga Musa!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ihyo Nikodemu, yula yo avaga ahele siku yimwe hachilo kwa Yesu nayo avaga yumwe va vavina iwo akavalonjelaje, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Mbe, malajitso ga Musa gamuhigaga munu bila kumuhulikitsa na kutsela chinu cho an'dita?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Nawo vakamupitulaje, “Mbe, heve nave uhumye ku Galilaya? Ubite ukagahime finofu Mandiko ga Mulungu nave ukutsela kuta ku Galilaya siakuhuma Muloli!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ihyo chila munu akawukaje na kubita kukaye kwake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mudala yo abatiche an'dita waafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Lechelelo Yesu akabitaje kuchidunda cha Mitseyituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Hamitondo iyage hamilawu Yesu akatsaje kaha Munyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, na vanu veka vakamupilimaje, akikalisaje na kwantsa kuvadahitsa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na Mafwalisayo vakamuletaje mudala yumwe yoali ibatiche an'dita waafu, vakamuvikaje hagatinagati ha vanu veka. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Iho vakamuputsaje, mudahitsi, Mudala yuno tumwibite an'dita waafu. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Malajitso ga Musa gatulajitsaga kuta vadala kota vano tuvatove na maganga mbaka vafwe, ino lelo heve unlonga ndawuli? <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Valongaga ihyo kwa kumujela, ili vapate chambutso cha kumuhiga. Lechelelo Yesu akahonamaje hasi, na kwantsa kwandika hasi kwa chala chake. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Hovavaga kwendelela kumuputsaputsa, Yesu akinukaje akavalonjelaje, “Manyi hana munu yoyuve hagati henyu yo angiwona alihela ndongwa ntsibi, alongole kumutova na maganga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Akahonamaje kaha na kwantsa kwandika hasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Vavaga kuhulika lulongwa ulo, vakantsaje kuwuka yumwe yumwe, kwantsila vagogolo mbaka akasigalaje Yesu aliyena, na yula mudala yo avaga imile halutalo hake. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu ho avaga kwinula mutwi siamuwene munu yunyi, ila yula mudala ng'ani, ihyo akamuputsaje, Bee, mudala! Valikwiya vala vanu wovakuhigije kuta una nongwa? <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Mudala yula akamupitulaje, “Muvina haduhu nambe yumwe.” Nayo Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Na heni singukuhiga. Duve ubite, ulekaje kudita ndongwa ntsibi kanji.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yo mwangatsa gwa vanu va inyi tseka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje kaha, “Heni yo mwangatsa gwa vanu va inyi tseka, munu yoyuve yo akufwata heni siakujenda mujitsa, lechelelo akuva na mwangatsa gwa wumi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mafwalisayo vakamulonjelaje, “Ndongwa itso tso ungutulonjela kwajili ya heve, ndonga iyo siyikudichilwa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu akavapitulaje, “Heni nambaje ntsingilonjela ntsimwene, ndonga yangu ya wukweli, kwakuva heni ntsin'tsela konyumye na kontsimbita. Lechelelo henye simukutsele konyumye wala kontsim'bita. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Henye munhiga kota vanu fyo vahigaga, lechelelo heni sintsimuhigaga munu yoyuve. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Lechelelo nambaje ntsingumuhiga munu, wuhigo wangu wa wuwuya, sinambe nyije ntsiliyena, ila nyigaga hamwe Dada yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Kaha mu malajitso ga Musa yandikwe kuta, cho vanlongaga vanu vavili tsivaga tsa wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Heni ntsingilonjela ntsimwene, nayo Dada vangu yo anumile nayo fyo anlonga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ihyo vakamuputsaje, “Yuyo Dada vako alikwiya?” Yesu akavajibulaje, “Henye simuntsele heni kuta ntsi nani, na kaha simumutsele Dada vangu. Mukamuntsele heni, muka kumutsela na Dada vangu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu alontsile ndongwa itso hoavaga an'dahitsa mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, habehi na chumba cho chavaga na sandiko ya kuvichila magobole. Lechelelo kuduhu munu yoyuve yo avetsitse kumubata kwasawuli luvala lwake lwavaga lung'ali kufika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga kuta kontsim'bita henye simukufika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kaha, “Heni ntsim'mbita na henye mukusaka, na henye mukufwa mu ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi. Kontsim'bita heni henye simukuvetsa kufika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ihyo vavina va Vayawudi vakalongaje “Mbee akikopola? Kwasawuli yachi alontsile kuta kontsim'bita heni henye simukuvetsa kufika?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Henye munhumila bahanago hasi, heni nyumye Kilanga kwa Mulungu. Henye yo muva mu inyi, heni sintsili va mu inyi yino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Hamutalo ntsali ntsivalonje kuta mukufwa mu ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi. Kwakuva manyi muleche kitumba kuta heni yo ntsimwene, mukufwa mu ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nawo vakamuputsaje, “Heve uli nani?” Nayo Yesu akavapitulaje, “Heni yo yula yo mbeye ntsinguvalonjela kuhuma hamutalo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />“Ntsinatso ndongwa ntsolofu tsa kuvalonjela na tsa kuvahiga henye. Lechelelo mwene yo anumile yo va wukweli, na heni ntsinlonga na vanu va inyi tseka ndongwa tsila tso ntsahuliche kuhuma kwake.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Vene sivakatselaga kuta Yesu avaga anlongana nawo ndongwa tsa Dada vake. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Hala homukuva mumwinwe Mwana va Munu muchanya mwa mubichi, iho homukutsela kuta, heni yo yula, ngalontsile hino heni sinditaga chinu kota fyo ntsin'gana, ila nditaga kota fyo andahitse Dada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Mwene yula yo anumile alihamwe na heni, siandesile ntsiyena, kwakuva siku tseka nditaga ndongwa tsila tso tsingumugan'ya.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Vanu wolofu wovamuhuliche Yesu ho alongaga ndongwa itso, vakamutumbaje.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wukweli wukuvadita mulechelwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje vala Vayawudi wovavaga vamutumbye, “Manyi mukalalile kutsidita ndongwa tsangu, mukuva vadahitswa vangu kweli kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Kahi mukuwutsela wukweli nawo wukweli wukuvadita mulechelwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Vene vakamupitulaje, “Hetwe tuli lulelo lwa Ibulahimu, sitwali tuva vapogotsi va munu luvala loluve, nave unlonga ndawuli kuta, mukulechelwa?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta chila munu yo an'dita ndongwa ntsibi akuva mupogotsi va ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mupogotsi saikalaga hakaye lwahisho, lechelelo mwana munyakaye yo ikalaga mukaye lwahisho. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ihyo manyi Mwana avadite mulechelwe, mukulechelwa nachene. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ntsin'tsela kuta henye yo muli lulelo lwa Ibulahimu. Nambe isho mun'gana kung'opola kwasawuli ndongwa tsangu tsilimuduhu munumbula tsenyu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Heni ntsinguvalonjela ndongwa tsila tso ntsatsiwene hala hontsavaga na Dada, hihyo na henye mun'dita ndongwa tsila tso muhuliche kuhuma kwa dada venyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Vene vakamupitulaje, “Dada vetu yo Ibulahimu.” Yesu akavajibulaje, muka muve muli vana va Ibulahimu, muka kuditaga ndongwa tso aditaga Ibulahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Lechelelo henye sambi mun'gana kung'opola heni yo ntsivalonje wukweli, wo nyuliche kwa Mulungu. Ibulahimu siadisile lulongwa kota ulo! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Henye mun'dita ndongwa tsila tso an'dita dada venyu. Vakamupitulaje, “Hetwe si tuli vana wotwaleliche mu waafu, tunayo Dada vetu yumwe duve, nayo yo Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Manyi Mulungu aka ave yo Dada venyu mukakungana, kwakuva ntsahumye kwa Mulungu na sambi ntsili hano. Heni sintsatsitse kwa kiganila ntsimwene, ila kwajili ya mwene yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Sinambe mwelewe madahitso gangu, kwasawuli sinambe muvetse kuhulika chontsinlonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Henye muli vana va dada venyu Lisoka, nanye mun'gana kukwitsa mbiniwo tsa dadenyu. Mwene uyo akopolaga kuhuma hamutalo, sinambe imilile wukweli, kwakuva alihela wukweli mugati mwake. Ho anlonga wudesi, alongaga kota fyoali mwene, kwasawuli mwene yo mudesi na yo dada va uwo wudesi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Heni ntsinlonga wukweli, henye mulema kunumba. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Mbe, hagati henyu hoyoli munu yoyuve yo afuluche alonje kuta heni ntsimunu munya ndongwa ntsibi? Manyi ntsinguvalonjela ndongwa tsa wukweli, kwasawuli yachi mulema kunumbila? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Munu yoyuve yo anhuma kwa Mulungu ahulikaga chila cho anlonga Mulungu. Henye sinambe muhulikitse ndongwa tsa Mulungu, kwasawuli henye si munhuma kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avaga hoyoli kabula ya Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Vayawudi vakamupitulaje Yesu, “Mbe, hetwe situnlonga wukweli kuta heve uli munu va ku Samaliya na kaha kuta heve una lihoka?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu akavapitulaje kuta, “Heni ntsihela lihoka, ila ntsingumuhesimila Dada vangu, lechelelo henye sinambe mumuhesimile. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Lechelelo heni sintsinsaka wuvina wangu, ila koyoli yo ansachila heni wuvina, nayo yo mulamutsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, munu yoyuve yo akudita ndongwa tsangu si akufwa siku tseka.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ihyo, Vayawudi vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Lelo tutselye kuta una lihoka! Manyi Ibulahimu afweeye na valoli va Mulungu nawo vafweye, lechelelo yiveye ndawuli heve unlonga, munu yoyuve yo akudita ndongwa tsangu si akufwa siku tseka? <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Mbe, heve uli muvina kulutila dada vetu Ibulahimu yo afweye na valoli va Mulungu nawo vafweye? Heve unhotsa kuta uli nani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu akavapitulaje, “Manyi ntsidutse tsimwene wuvina wangu wukuva siyo chinu. Dada vangu yo antsumitsa, yoyuyo na henye yo munlonga kuta yo Mulungu vetu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Henye simwamutselaga, lechelelo heni ntsimutsele. Manyi ndonje kuta sintsimutsele nguva tsimudesi kota henye. Lechelelo heni ntsimutsele na kutsidita cho anlonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Kukwenyu Ibulahimu ahechelye kwasawuli ya hila fyo ayiwene siku yangu, nayo akayiwene na akahechelelaje.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Vayawudi vakamuputsaje, “Heve siufisise nambe miyaka hamusini, nave unlonga kuta wamuwene Ibulahimu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, Ibulahimu hoavaga ang'ali kuleleka, heni mwanga ntsali koyoli.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ihyo vakaholaje maganga ili vamutove, lechelelo Yesu akafihamaje na akahumaje mula mu Nyumba ya Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponentsa munu chibofu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Siku yimwe Yesu hoavaga anlutila akamuwonaje munu yumwe, chibofu kuhuma kuleleka kwake. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Ihyo Vadahitswa vake vakamuputsaje, “Mudahitsi! Nani yoadisile ndongwa ntsibi, munu yuno awu valeli vake, mbaka aleleche chibofu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Munu yuno na valeli vake sivadisile ndongwa ntsibi, ila lulongwa ulu luhumye ili wuvetso wa Mulungu wuwoneche mugati mwake. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tun'ganika tukole katsi tsake mwene yo anumile kung'acha hamunyi, kwakuva chilo chinkutsa kuduhu munu yoakuvetsa kukola katsi yoyive. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Luvala lontsili mu inyi, heni yo mwang'atsa gwa vanu va mu inyi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Avaga kulonga itso, akafunyaje mati hanyi, akafinyangaje lilongo, akamubakaje yula chipofu mumiho, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Kaha amulonjelaje, “Bite ukakalave mulikwava lya Siloamu.” Chinya kutijila, yo atumilwe. Duve yula chibofu akabitaje kukalava, nayo akawuyaje kuno an'lola. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Vanu va habehi na mwene wovavaga vamutsele iho hamutalo vakalongaje kuta avaga mugayu na mususi, vakiputsaje, “Mbe! Uyu siyula mugayu yoikalaga na kusuka?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Vamwinga vakalongaje, “Yo mwene.” Vamwinga vakalongaje, “Ndaya simwene ila ihwana nayo.” Lechelelo yula yoali chipofu akalongaje, “Yo heni baha.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ihyo vakavaje vangumuputsa, “Lelo miho gako gadisilwe ndawuli mbaka ulole?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nayo akavapitulaje, “Yula munu yo anchemwa Yesu adisile lidope, akambakaje mumiho nakundonjela, bite ukakalave ku litsimbwi lya Siloamu. Iho heni hongabitaje kukalava, ho iho ngantsaje kulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Vakamuputsaje kaha, “Mwene munu uyo alikwiya?” Nayo akavapitulaje, “Heni sinambe ntsele koali.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafwalisayo Vamputsanitsa hila fyo aponitswe Chibofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ihyo duve vakamusindikaje kwa Mafwalisayo yula yo avaga chibofu iho hamtalo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Siku iyo Yesu yo adisile lidope na kugaponetsa miho ga yula munu, yavaga Siku ya Kwesela. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ihyo Mafwalisayo vakatsaje kumupuntsa munu yula, “Ulotsile ndawuli?” Nayo akavalonjelaje kuta ambasile lidope mumiho, na heni ngabitaje kukalava na lelo ntsinlola. <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafwalisayo vamwe vakalongaje, “Munu uyu siahumye kwa Mulungu, kwakuva siangibata malajitso ga Siku ya Kwesela.” Lechelelo vamwe vakalongaje, “Munu yo an'dita ndongwa ntsibi akuvetsa ndawuli kudita ndajilo kota tsino?” kukavaje na usumwano hagati hawo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Ihyo vakamulonjelaje lwakavili yula munu yoavaga chibofu, “Heve yo uponitswe miho unlonga chichi kwajili ya munu uyo?” Nayo akavalonjelaje, “Mwene uyo yo muloli va Mulungu!” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vala vavina va Vayawudi sivamutumbye kuta munu uyo avaga chibofu hamutalo, na lelo anlola, mbaka hovavachemile valeli vake. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Vakavaputsaje valeli vake kuta mbe, uyu mwanenyu yo henye mulonga kuta aleliche chibofu? Lelo yiveye ndawuli sambi anlola? <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Valeli vake vakapitulaje, “Tuntsela kuta uyu yo mwanetu, na aleliche chibofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Lecheleo hetwe situn'tsela kuta yiveye ndawuli mbaka an'lola sambi, wala situngumutsela yo amugubwe miho gake. Mumuwutse mwene kwasawuli mwene munu muvina na anventsa kulonga.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Valeli vake valontsile ihyo kwakuva vawogopaga Vayawudi, kwasawuli Vayawudi vali vapatine kuta munu yoyuve yo akumudichila Yesu kuta yo Chilisito akubagulwa na kuvikwa kivala kwa Nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Icho cho chambwitse valeli vake valonje kuta, “Mwene munu muvina mumuputse mwene.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Vakamuchemaje kaha munu yula yo avaga chibofu, vakamulonjelaje, “Umupele Mulungu ntsumitso tsake! Hetwe tun'tsela kuta munu yula yo akuponitse munya ndongwa ntsibi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Mwene akalongaje, “Heni sintsin'tsela kuta uyo munu munya ndongwa ntsibi, lechelelo chontsin'tsela chinu chimwe hela, kuta ntsava chibofu na sambi ntsilola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Vakamuputsaje kaha, “Akuditye chichi? Akugubwe ndawuli miho gako?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Akavapitulaje kaha, “Mwanga ntsivalonje na henye nambe munyuliktse. Lelo mun'gana ndonje chichi ili munyuliche? Mbe henye nanye mugana muve vadahitswa vake?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Lechelelo vene vakamuligaje kwa kulonga, “Heve yo uli mudahitswa vake ila hetwe tuli vadahitswa va Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Hetwe tuntsela kuta Mulungu alontsile na Musa, lechelelo munu yuno situn'tsela koahumye!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Yula munu chibofu akavapitulaje, “Ulu lulongwa lwa mutinuso! Henye simun'tsela koahumye, nayo andisile miho gangu galave! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Kaha akavalonjelaje hetwe tun'tsela kuta Mulungu siavahukitsaga vanu vanya ndongwa ntsibi, ila amuhulikitsaga munu yoyuve yo an'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu na kumufwata. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Luhuma kuwumbwa kwa inyi sitwali tuhuliche kuta kwali na munu yo amuponitse munu yoyuve yo avaga aleliche chibofu alole. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Manyi munu uyu akaave siahumye kwa Mulungu si akakuvetsa kudita chinu chochive.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Vene vakamupitulaje kuta, “Heve waleliche kuno una ndongwa ntsibi, nave unvetsa ndawuli kutudahitsa hetwe?” Nawo vakamuvingaje ahume kivala ku nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafwalisayo vanlemwa kumuntsela wukweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika kuta vamuvintsile kivala yula munu mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi yula, akamuputsaje, “Mbe, heve ungumutumba Mwana va Munu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Uyo munu akajibulaje, “Muvina, undonjele mwene uyo yo nani, ili ntsimutumbe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Mwanga umuwene, nayo yo yuno yo unlongana nayo sambi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ihyo yula munu akalongaje, “Ntsingukutumba Mutwa,” Akamufugamilaje. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, ntsitsitse mu inyi kwasawuli ya kuhiga, ili yo sivanlola vavetse kulola, navala yo vanlola vave fibofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafwalisayo vamwe wo vavaga hamwe nayo vavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakamuputsaje, “Mbe, hetwe natwe tuli fibofu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu akavapitulaje kuta, muka muve fibofu simuka kuva na ndongwa ntsibi, lechelelo kwasawuli henye munlonga kuta, hetwe tunlola, ihyo duve ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi sitsihulumilwe na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mudimi muwuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, munu yoyuve yo ankwinjila mu ligagala lya ng'olo kukolela mu lwitsi, lechelelo ankwinjila mugati kwa kukola hono hanji, uyo muhitsi na muwumiyani. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Mwene yo ankwinjila kwa kukolela ha lwitsi uyo yo mudimi va ng'olo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mwimilitsi umudindulilaga lwitsi, na ng'olo yihulikaga litsi lyake. Nayo atsichemaga ng'olo tsake kwa matawa gawo na kutsisindika kivala. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Manyi atsihumye kivala, atsilongolaga kulutalo natso ng'olo tsimufwataga kwasawuli tsilitsele litsi lyake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ng'olo itso sitsikumufwata mujentsi, ila tsikumubilima, kwasawuli sitsilitsele litsi lya mujentsi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu avalonje kwa muhwano ugo, lechelelo vene sivavaga vantsela chila cho avalonjelaga.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yo mudimi muwuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje kaha, ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta heni ntsi lwitsi lwa ng'olo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Veka wo vandongwe iwo vahitsi na vawumiyani, lechelelo ng'olo sitsikavahuliche. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Heni ntsi lwitsi munu yoyuve yo akwinjila kwa kukolela kwa heni akukuluka, akwinjila na kuhuma kivala, natso tsikupata hono ho tsikulya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Muhitsi atsaga ili kuhitsa, kukopola na kwananga. Heni tsatsitse ili vave na wumi, kaha vave nawo wumi wo wukwilye. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Heni ntsi mudimi muwuya. Mudimi muwuya atawulaga wumi wake kwasawuli ya ng'olo. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mudimi va kuhombwa yula yo ng'olo siyo tsake, hala manyi ayiwone ngwami yinkutsa, abilimaga na kutsileka ng'olo, na ngwami tsitsibataga na kutsitagalitsa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Abilimaga kwasawuli mwene yo mudimi va kuhombwa, na ndongwa tsa ng'olo kwake si chinu ndaya. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Heni tsi mudimi muwuya. Ntsitsitsele ng'olo tso tsangu na ng'olo tsangu tsintsele heni, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kota hila Dada fyo an'ngana heni, na heni fyo ntsingumugana Dada vangu. Hihyo na heni ntsilichang'ani kutawula wumi wangu kwajili ya ng'olo tsangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ntsinatso ng'olo tsinji tsositsa mwigagala lino, natso ntsin'ganika ntsitsilete hotsili. Natso tsikutsela litsi lyangu, na ihyo kukuva na chipinga chimwe na mudimi yumwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Chinu cho an'ganila Dada vangu cho ichi, ntsinguwutawula wumi wangu ili ntsiwutegule kanji. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kuduhu munu yo akunyetsela wumi wangu, ila ntsinguwutawula kwakugana ntsimwene. Ntsina wuvetso wa kuwutawula na kaha ntsinawo wuvetso wa kuwutegula kanji. Lilajitso lino ntsanuchye kuhuma kwa Dada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Vayawudi hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso tsa Yesu vakatelanaje. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Vamwinga vakalongaje, uyuno ana lisoka na kanji ana lukwale! Kwasawuli yachi mungumuhulikitsa? <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Vamwe vakalongaje, “Ndongwa tsa ihyo siafuluche alonje munu munya lihoka. Mbe, lisoka lifuluche limuponetse miho munu chibofu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankanwa na Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Lulavala ulo kuko Yelusalemu kwavaga na liwungo lya kuyivika kaha chang'ani Nyumba ya Mulungu kwasawuli ya Mulungu. Nalo lwavaga luvala lwa chisisima. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Nayo Yesu avaga an'jenda mugati mwa Nyumba ya Mulungu, mulidama lya Selemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Vayawudi vakamukong'anilaje na kumuputsa kuta, “Ukutuvika mu mahotso na kiputsa munumbula tsetu mbaka hanili? Manyi heve yo Chilisito, chiba utulonjele bila kufiha.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu akavapitulaje, “Mwanga ntsivalonje lechechelo henye sinambe munumbe. Katsi tsino tso ntsin'dita kwa mamulaka ga Dada vangu, itso tsin'ndajila kuta heni yo nani. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Lechelelo henye sinambe munumbe heni, kwasawuli henye simuli ng'olo tsangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Kota hila ng'olo fyo tsilihulikaga litsi lya mudimi vawo, na vanu vangu vanguchitsela cho ntsinlonga. Ntsinguvatsela nawo vaveye vadahitswa vangu, <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />na heni ntsinguvapela wumi wo wugaya wudugo, na sivakuhogola kulekana na Mulungu. Kaha kuduhu munu yo akuvasukula mu mawoko gangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Dada vangu yo amelye vanu iwo, nayo yo muvina kulutila veka, na kaha kuduhu munu yo akuvetsa kuvasukula kuhuma mu mawoko gake. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Heni na Dada vangu tuli chinu chimwe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ihyo Vayawudi vakaholaje kaha maganga ili vamutove Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsivalaje ndajilo ntsolofu na ngomi kuhuma kwa Dada. Ino lelo mundonjele, kwasawuli ya ndajilo yachi hagati ha itso mun'gana munove kwa maganga?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Vayawudi vakamupitulaje, “Situngukutova na maganga kwasawuli ya katsi nofu tso udisile, ila tungukutova kwasawuli ya kumuliga Mulungu! Heve uli munu hela ila ungidita kuta unakota Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu akavapitulaje, “Mbe, siyandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, henye munakota Mulungu? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Manyi vanu vala wo va pelitwe Mandiko ga Mulungu vihwana na mwene, lulongwa ulo luli hihyo kuta Mandiko ga Mulungu ga wukweli siku tseka. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Mbe, mufuluche muvetse ndawuli kumulonjela yula yo atawulwe na Dada kwa katsi yake na kumutuma ku inyi, kuta anliga kwasawuli ndontsile, heni yo Mwana va Mulungu? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Manyi nambe ng'ole katsi tsa Dada, muleche kunumba. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Lechelelo manyi yive ntsinkola katsi tsa Dada, na muvaje mulema kunumba heni duve mutsitumbe itso katsi, ili mutsele kuta Dada ali mugati mwangu na heni ntsili mugati mwa Dada.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Vakajelaje kaha kumubata, lechelelo Yesu akavapulusukaje mumawoko gako. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu akalowaje kaha mwambu gwa lulenga lwa Yolidani, hono hala ho Yohana avaga am'batitsa vanu na kikala kuko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Vanu wolofu vakabitaje kwa Yesu, na vakavaje vanlonga kuta wukweli Yohana siadisile nambe ndajilo yimwe, lechelelo chila ndongwa tso alontsile kwajili ya munu yuno tsavaga wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Kuko vanu wolofu vakamutumbaje Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kutajika kwa Latsalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Kwavaga na munu yumwe yo avaga mutamwa yo achemwaga Latsalo. Munu uyo ikalaga ku muji gwa Betsaniya, vikalasaga hamwe na vahatsave wo vachemwaga Maliyamu na Malita. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Uyo Maliyamu yo yuyula yo amubasile Mutwa mafuta go gapuchilila ga galama ngomi, na kugapata magulu kwa fwili tsake. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ihyo Vahatsave iwo vakavatumaje vanu kwa Yesu vamulonjele kuta, “Mutwa, yula muyago antamika.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ihyo, akalongaje, “Latsalo siakufwa kwa wutamwa wuno, ila uwu wukulajila wumelemo wa Mulungu, na kaha wukudita Mwana va Mulungu atsumitswe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Nayo Yesu viyendaga ndalahela na Malita, na Maliyamu na Latsalo muhatsa vawo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Lechelelo Yesu hoavaga kuhulika kuta Latsalo antamika, akendelelaje kuhava kono kuko nayo ichite siku tsinji tsivili. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Hambele hotsavaga kulutila siku itso akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Lelo tuwuye kaha ku Yudeya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Vadahitswa vake vakamulonjelaje, “Mudahitsi, hitsutsitsutsi hela baha Vayawudi vaganaga kukupola kwa maganga kuko, nave un'gana kaha kuwuya kuko?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu akavapitulaje kuta, “Mbe, sikuna masala kumi na gavili ga hamunyi kwa siku yimwe? Ihyo vanu vala veka wo vajendaga hamunyi sivikuvalaga kwasawuli vanguguwona mwangatsa gwa inyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Lechelelo vanu wo van'jenda hachilo vikuvalaga kwasawuli valihela mwangatsa gwa kuvatanga kulola.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu avaga kulonga ndongwa itso akawilaje kaha kuvalonjela, “Muyetu Latsalo avasise tulo, lechelelo heni ntsim'bita ngamulamuse.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Vadahitswa vake vakamulonjelaje, bee Mutwa, manyi avasise tulo hela akulamuka. <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Lechelelo Yesu avaga anlonga kwajili ya chifo cha Latsalo, ila vala vadahitswa vake sivatselaga, vatyaga anlonga kuta Latsalo avasise tulo hela. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje bila kuvafiha kuta, “Latsalo afweye, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />lechelelo ntsinhechelela kwakuva sintsika kuko Latsalo hoavaga ang'ali kufwa, ili munumbe. Lelo tubite kwake.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi yo achemwaga Mubasa, akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vayage, “Hetwe natwe tubitase na Mudahitsi, manyi kufwa tukafwe hamwe na Mutwa!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yo wutsilipuko na Wumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu hoavaga kufika uko afisile muvili gwa Latsalo mwanga gutsisilwe, na guna siku tsitayi kuhuma gutsikwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Chijiji cha Betsaniya chavaga habehi na Yelusalemu, wutali wake wavaga kota chilomita tsidatu hino. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Vayawudi wolofu vavaga vatsitse kuvahongetsa Malita na Maliyamu kwa chivembo cha mung'olotsawo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Nayo Malita hoavaga kuhulika kuta Yesu ankutsa, akabitaje kumutang'anitsa, ila Maliyamu akasigalaje munyumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malita akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Bee Mutwa uka uve ulibaha, muhatsa vangu si akakufwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Lechelelo nambe sambi ntsin'tsela kuta chochive cho ukumusuka Mulungu, akukupela.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu akamulonjelaje “Muhatsawo akutsilipuka.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malita akamujibulajekuts ntsin'tsela kuta akutsilipuka ha luvala lwa wutsilipuko ha siku ya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu akamulonjelaje “Heni yo wutsilipuko na wumi. Mwene yo an'numba heni, na yivaje akufwa akuva mumi, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />na munu yoyuve yo alimumi na an'numba heni, uyo si akufwa nachene. Mbe, ungulutumba lulongwa ulu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malita akamulonjelaje, “Ena Mutwa! Ntsintumba kuta heve yo Chilisito muhagulwa na Mulungu, Mwana va Mulungu yula yo ankutsa mu inyi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuvembela Latsalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Malita hoavaga kulonga ndongwa itso, akabitaje akamuchemelaje halubali Maliyamu mung'olotse na kumulonjela kuta, “Mudahitsi alibaha angukuchema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Nayo Maliyamu avaga kuhulika ihyo, akasupanitsaje kuwuka na kubita ko ali Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu avaga ang'ali kufika mu chijiji, ila avaga ang'acha hono hala ho itang'ine na Malita. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Vala Vayawudi wo vavaga hamwe na Maliyamu munyumba vangumuhongetsa, hovavaga kuwona hila fyo awusile kwa kusupanitsa, vakamufwataje vahotsaga kuta am'bita kukabuli akalomboketse kuko. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maliyamu avaga kufika hono hala ho avaga Yesu, akafugamaje hamagulu gake, na kumulonjela kuta, “Mutwa, uka uve iha muhatsavangu si akakufwa!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu avaga kumuwona Maliyamu anvemba na vala Vayawudi wo vamusindikitse nawo vanvemba, Yesu akawonaje wusungu munumbula yake. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Akavaputsaje, “Mumutsisile kwiya?” Vakamupitulaje kuta, “Mutwa, utse uhawone hotumutsisile!” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu akavembaje. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ihyo Vayawudi vakalongaje, “Mulave hila fyo amuganaga Latsalo!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Lechelelo vanu vamwe vakalongaje, “Mbe, yuno yo amuponitse yula chibofu, akakulemwa kumuponetsa Latsalo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumutsilipula Latsalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Kaha Yesu hoavaga na wusungu munumbula yake, akafikaje hala ha kabuli. Kabuli yene yavaga malika, na liganga lyavaga ligubikwe ha winjililo. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu akalongaje, “Mulihetse ilyo liganga!” Malita muhatsave va yula yo atajiche akamulonjelaje, “Mutwa, antsitse kunung'a, kwakuva ichite siku tsitayi mukabuli!” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu akamulonjelaje Malita, “Mbe, singulonje kuta manyi unumbe ukuwuwona wumelemo wa Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ihyo vakalihetsaje lila liganga. Yesu akinulaje miho gake Kilanga kwa Mulungu akusukaje akalongaje, “Dada vangu ntsingukulumba, kwasawuli heve un'nyulika. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ntsin'tsela kuta heve unyulikaga siku tseka, lechelelo ndontsile hino ili vanu vano wolofu wo vimile hano, ili vitumbe kuta heve yo unumile.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Hoavaga kulonga ndongwa itso, Yesu akachemaje kwa litsi likomi kuta, “Heve Latsalo, utse kuno kivala!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Yula yo avaga afweye akahumaje kivala, kuno apilingitswe sanda mawoko na magulu gake, na kaha avaga awopitwe chitambala kumiho. Yesu akavalonjelaje, mumuwopole na kumuleka abite.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vavina va Vavayawudi vampanga hila fyo kumukopola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lukasi 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ihyo vala Vayawudi wolofu wovavaga vatsitse kumuhongetsa Maliyamu, hovavaga kuwona ndongwa tsila, vakamutumbaje Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Lechelelo vanji vakabitaje kwa Mafwalisayo na kuvalonjela ndongwa itso tso adisile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ihyo vavina va vatawula nambiko hamwe na Mafwalisayo, vakavikaje chikalo mulibalatsa na kiputsa kuta, “Tun'dita chichi? Munu yuno an'dita ndajilo ntsolofu. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Manyi tumuleche endelele hihinago kudita ndajilo, chila munu akumutumba, na vatavala va ku Lumi vakutsa na kutuhetsela mamulaka getu ga Nyumba ya Mulungu na inyi yetu!” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Munu yumwe hagati hawo yo achemwaga Kayafwa, yo avaga muvina vatawula nambiko mwaka gula, akavalonjelaje, “Henye nambe mutsele chinu chochive! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Mbe, henye simun'tsela kuta chiba munu yumwe afwe kwasawuli ya vanu, kuliko kwananjika kwa inyi yeka?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Lulongwa ulo si alontsile kwa mahotso gake mwene, ila kwakuva avaga Muvina va Vatawula nambiko mwaka ugo, alontsile ndongwa tsa kulutalo kuta Yesu akufwa kwasawuli ya inyi ya Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Wala siyo kuta akufwa kwasawuli ya inyi iyo ya Vayawudi ng'ani, ila kwasawuli ya kuvakong'asa vana va Mulungu wo vatagalye vave wovamwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ihyo kuhuma chimunyi icho vakantsaje kusaka hila fyo vafuluche vamukopole Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Yesu akalekaje kujenda kanji hono helu hagati ha Vayawudi, ila akibagulaje na kubita hono ho halihabehi na kumbuga, mbaka ku chijiji cho chinchemwa Efulahimu, akikalaje kuko hamwe na vadahitswa vake. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Luvala lwa Liwungo lya Pasaka ya Vayawudi lyavaga habehi kufika, na vanu wolofu vavaga vahumye ku fijiji na kubita ku Yelusalemu, ili liwungo lya Pasaka holikuva ling'acha kufika vave vivisile chang'ani kwasawuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Vanu vavaga vangumusaka Yesu, nawo hovavaga vimile mu Nyumba ya Mulungu vakalonganaje na kiputsa kuta, “Mbe, munu yula siafuluche atse ha Liwungo lino?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Vavina va vatawula nambiko na Mafwalisayo vavaga valajitse kuta, manyi munu yoyuve manyi atsele hoali Yesu, avalonjele ili vakamubate.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maliyamu angumubaka Yesu Mafuta go ganun'nyilila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Hotsavaga tsing'acha siku sita kufika Liwungo lya Pasaka, Yesu akabitaje ku Betsaniya hono ho ikalaga Latsalo yo avaga amutsilipwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Vakamuvichilaje chang'ani chilyo cha mumihe, na luvala ulo Malita avaga mutelesi va chilyo. Nayo Latsalo avaga yumwe va vanu wo vavaga vichite hamwe na Yesu kulya. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Ihyo Maliyamu akategulaje supa yinya mafuta ga beyi ngomi go ganchemwa nalido go gan'nunyilila ndalahela, akamubakaje Yesu mumagulu na kubakatsa kwa fwili tsake. Nyumba yeka yikanunyililaje mafuta igo. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ihyo Yuda Isikaliyoti, yumwe va vala vadahitsi vake kumi na vavili, yo akutsa kumupituka Yesu, akalongaje, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Kwasawuli ya chichi mafuta gano gakagagutswe sava na mahombo ga siku mya tsa mutantsi va kutsenga, na magobole igo vapelwe vagayu?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yuda alontsile ihyo siyo kwasawuli ya kuvawonela lusungu vatsunwa, ila kwakuva avaga muhitsi. Mwene yo avaga muvisi va bogolo ya kuvichila magobole, nayo avaga anhitsa fyo fivisilwe umo. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Lechelelo Yesu akalongaje, “Muleche kumutifya mudala uyo! Mwene agutsile mafuta igo ili ambache muvili kwasawuli ya siku yangu ya kutsikwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Kwasawuli vatsunwa muli hamwe nawo siku tseka, lechelelo simukuva hamwe na heni siku tseka.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi van'gana kumukopola Latsalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Lilugu lya Vayawudi holyavaga kuhulika kuta Yesu avaga ku Betsaniya, vakatsaje siyo kwajili ya Yesu ng'ani, ila vatsitse kwajili ya kumuwona Latsalo yo atsilipulwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Nawo vavina va vatawula nambiko vakalaganaje kaha na hila fyo vakumukopola Latsalo. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Kwasawuli Vayawudi wolofu vakibagulaje na vavina vawo, na kumutumba Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwinjila Yelusalemu kwa ngulugulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lukasi 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Siku ya kavili vanu wolofu wovavaga vatsitse ku Liwungo lya Pasaka vahuliche kuta Yesu alimung'asi ankutsa ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Vakatolaje miputi ja mibichi ja mitende, na kuhuma kivala kubita kumwanuchila kuno vimbaga hino, “Tumutsumitse Mutwa! Atambichilwe uyo yo ankutsa kwasawuli ya Mulungu. Atambichilwe Muntsajila va Isilaheli.” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu akayifikaje ntsana ya ntsove akakwinaje na kikala ku mugongo gwake, kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />henye vanu va Yelusalemu, muleche kuwona muloto. Mumulave! Muntsajila venyu ankutsa, akwinile ntsana ya ntsove. <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Hamutalo iho vadahitswa vake Yesu sivakatselaga ndongwa itso, lechelelo Mulungu hoavaga kulajila hila Yesu fyo muvina, iho ho vakiwukaje kuta ndongwa itso tsavaga tsandikwe kwasawuli yake Yesu na vamuditye mwene. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Lila lilugu lya vanu lyo lyavaga hamwe na Yesu luvala ulo ho amuchemaga Latsalo kuhuma mukabuli na kumutsilipula, vendelye kuhadisila ndongwa tsila tso tsavaga tsihumye. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Kwasawuli ilyo lilugu lya vanu lyamwanuche Yesu, kwakuva veka vavaga vahuliche kuta avaga adisile ndajilo iyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Ihyo Mafwalisayo vakilonjelaje kuta, “Mun'wona? Hetwe si tulichinu ndaya! Mulole lelo, vanu veka vangumufwata mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga hila fyo akufwa na kutsilipuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kwavaga na Vajilichi vamwe hagati ha vanu wovali vahele ku Yelusalemu kumuhonamila Mulungu luvala lwa Liwungo ilyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Vanu iwo vakabitaje kwa Fwilipo munyakaye va ku Betitsayida ya ku Galilaya vakamusukaje kwa kulonga, “Muvina, tun'gana kumuwona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Fwilipo akabitaje na kumulonjela Andeleya, nawo veka vavili vakabitaje kumulonjela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Nayo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwanga lufisile luvala lwa kulajilwa wuvina wa Mwana va Munu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, meche ya ngano manyi yileche kumitswa mu lilongo, yifwe na kota, yisigalaga kuva meche yimwe hihyo. Lechelelo manyi yifwe yilelaga meche ntsolofu. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Vanu vala yo vanguwugana wumi wawo, iwo vakuwuyatsa, na vala yo vanguwuvipila wumi wawo mu inyi yino, vakuwukulusa mbaka ku wumi wo wugaya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Munu yoyuve yo an'numichila an'ganika afwate heni, na hono hohave hontsili heni iho hoakuva na mutantsi vangu. Kaha na munu yoyuve yo akunumichila heni, Dada vangu akumuhesimila.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumusuka Mulungu kwasawuli ya chifo chake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Yesu akawilaje kulonga, “Lelo sambi numbula yangu yinkodeka ndalahela. Ino ndonje chinu chachi? Mbe, ndonje kuta Dada, ung'uluse nyume mu ng'odeko tsino? Ndaya! Ntsatsitse ili ntsifwe kwasawuli ya vanu vanji. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Dada, ulitsumitse litawa lyako.” Ihyo litsi likalongaje kuhuma Kilanga kuta, “Ntsilitsumitse, na ngulitsumitsa kaha.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Lila lilugu lya vanu yovali vimile iho vakalihulikaje litsi ilyo, na vamwe vawo vakalongaje, “Ilyo likuva lijilimo lya liladu.” Lechelelo vamwe vakalongaje, “Mutantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu anlongana nayo.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Nayo Yesu akalongaje, “Litsi ilyo lihumye siyo kwasawuli ya heni, ila kwasawuli ya henye. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Lelo ulu lo luvala lwa vanu va mu inyi tseka kuhigwa, na ihyo mutavala va inyi tseka tsino akusukulwa mamulaka gake. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Heni honguva kutumbikwa mu mubichi kuhuma mu inyi, ngumukwega chila munu atse kwa heni.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu alontsile ndongwa itso kuvalajila kuta akufwa chifo chachi.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Lilugu lila lya vanu likatovaje chiyove kuta, “Hetwe tuhuliche mu malajitso ga Musa kuta, Chilisito Muhagulwa va Mulungu akikala siku tseka bila wudugo. Kwasawuli yachi heve unlonga kuta Mwana va Munu akuganika kutumbikwa mu mubichi? Uyo Mwana va Munu yo nani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwanga mung'ali mung'acha hamwe na mwangatsa kwa luvala ludodo hela. Ihyo mun'ganika kujenda mu mwangatsa ugo ili jitsa lileche kuvafika, kwasawuli vanu wo vajendaga mu jitsa sivakutselaga kula ko vam'bita. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Ino lelo mun'ganika mugutumbe mwangatsa, na ihyo homukuva vana va mwangatsa.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Vayawudi vanlema kumutumba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu hoavaga kulonga ndongwa itso akawukaje na kubita kifiha. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Lechelelo nayivaje Yesu adisile ndajilo itso tseka halutalo hawo, vene valemile kumutumba, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />na ihyo tsikakwilaje ndongwa tso avaga alontsile Yisaya muloli va Mulungu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Mutwa, nani yoatsitumbye ndongwa tsetu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Nayo nani yo avagubulwe wuwetso wa kukulusa wa Mulungu?<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ihyo sivitumbye kwasawuli Yisaya avaga alontsile kaha hono hanji kuta,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />Mulungu avabofwitse miho gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na numbula ntsawo tsive nalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ili valeche kulola kwa miho gawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">nambe kudaha kwa numbula tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">hambi valapituka vanumbile na heni ntsivaponetse.<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Yisaya alontsile ndongwa itso kwasawuli avaga mwanga awuwene wumelemo wa Yesu nayo akalongaje ndongwa tsake. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Nayivaje ihyo, kwavaga na vavina wolofu va Vayawudi wovamutumbye Yesu. Lechelelo kwasawuli ya Mafwalisayo vakalemwaje kumuhala Yesu halutalo ha vanu. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kwasawuli vene vaganaga kutsumilwa na vanu kuliko kutsumilwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atsitse kuvakulusa vanu va inyi tseka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu akalongaje fikami kuta, “Manyi munu anumbile heni, siakuva anumbye heni ng'ani, ila akuva amutumbye na yula yo anumile heni. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Nayo munu yula yo ambwene heni, akuva amuwene yula yo anumile heni. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Heni ntsatsitse kwa vanu va inyi tseka ili vave na mwangatsa gwa wukweli wa Mulungu, ili chila munu yo akunumbila heni aleche kusigala mujitsa kwa kuleka kutsela wukweli wa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />“Manyi munu atsihuliche ndongwa tsangu lechelelo sinambe atsidite kota hila fyo tsin'gana singumuhiga, kwakuva heni ntsatsitse kuvahiga vanu va mu inyi ila ntsatsitse kuvakulusa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Munu yoyuve yo akuleka kuhulikitsa ndongwa tsangu na kuleka kwanuchila. Ndongwa tso ntsingumulonjela, itso tso tsikumuhiga ha siku ya wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Kwasawuli heni sintsalontsile kwa mamulaka gangu, ila Dada yo anumile ndonje chichi, na ndongwa tsachi tso ntsin'ganika kulonga. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Heni ntsin'tsela kuta malajitso gake go wumi wo wugaya wudugo. Ihyo lulongwa loluve lontsinlonga, ulo lo anumile Dada ntsilulonje.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvakalafya magulu vadahitswa vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Holwavaga luvala lwa Liwungo lya Pasaka luli habehi. Kuno Yesu antsela kuta luvala lwake lwa kuwuka muinyi na kubita kwa Dada mwanga lwavaga lufisile. Nayo avaga avaganile ndalahela vanu vake va muinyi, ena avaga avaganile mbaka kuwutawula wumi wake <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake hovavaga vankulya chilyo cha mumihe. Lihoka lyavaga mwanga lingitse lihotso mu numbula ya Yuda Isikaliyote mwana va Simoni ili amupituche Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu kuno atselaga kuta Dada mwanga avisile chila chinu mu mamulaka gake, na kuta mwene ahumye kwa Mulungu na atselaga kuta ampiluka kwa Mulungu, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ihyo akalekaje kulya chilyo akawukaje kuhuma hono hala, akawopolaje mugolole gwake, akategulaje chitambala chikomi cha kipatila malenga mu muvili, akipinyaje muchigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Kaha akahumitsaje malenga mulibakuli likomi na kwantsa kuvakalafya vadahitswa vake mu magulu na kuvapata malenga kwa chitambala chila cho avaga ipinyile muchigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Yesu akafikaje hoavaga Simoni Petulo, nayo Simoni Petulo akamuputsaje, “Mutwa! Mbe, ukung'alafya na heni magulu?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu akamujibulaje, “Sambihano sukuchitsela chila chontsin'dita, lechelelo ukutsela kulutalo.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petulo akamulonjelaje kuta, ndaya, heve siukung'alafya magulu gangu nachene Yesu akamulonjelaje, manyi ulema ngukalafye magulu siukuva na wuhantso na heni. <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Ihyo Simoni Petulo akamupitulaje, “Mutwa, uleche kung'alafya magulu ng'ani, lechelelo ung'alafye mawoko gangu na mutwi nago!” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Munu yoyuve yo mwanga otsile siaganikaga koga kanji lechelelo kukalava magulu ng'ani, kwasawuli muvili gwake mwanga gwetsile. Henye mwanga mwetsile, ila siyo nyeka.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu alontsile hila kuta siyo nyeka yo mwetsile, kwasawuli mwanga amutselaga yula yo akumupituka. <verse eid="JHN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Hoavaga kusinda kuvakalafya magulu, akafwalaje kaha mugolole gwake, akikalisaje hono hahala ha chilyo na kuvaputsa, ndawuli, mweliwe chontsivaditye? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Henye munyema heni mudahitsi na Mutwa ihyo munlonga wukweli, kwasawuli ho hihyo heni fyontsili. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ihyo manyi heni ntsi Mutwa venyu na Mudahitsi venu ntsivakalifye henye magulu, mun'ganika na henye mwikalafyaje magulu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Heni ntsivalaje muhwano kuta mun'ganika kudita kota hila fyo ntsivaditye henye. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, mupogotsi si avaga muvina kulutila mutwa vake, na kahi yo antumwa si avaga muvina kulutila yula yo amutumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Lelo kwakuva mutsitselye ndongwa itso, mukutambichilwa na Mulungu manyi mukutsidita.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Sintsinlonga kwasawuli ya henye nyeka, ila ntsinguvatsela vala wo ntsivahagwe. Lechelelo yin'ganika Mandiko ga Mulungu gakwile kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 13:18">Munu yula yo alyeye chilyo hamwe na heni, uyo aveye tebe na heni.<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Heni ntsinguvalonjela ndongwa tsino tsing'acha tsing'ali kuhumila, ili hotsikuhumila mutumbe kuta, heni yo mwene. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, munu yo yuve yo angumwanuchila yula yo ntsimutumile, akuva antsanuchila heni, na yula yo antsanuchila heni akuva angumwanuchila yula yo anumile.<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga hila fyo akupitukwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Lukasi 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu hoavaga kulonga ndongwa itso, akasusutalaje ndalahela mu numbula yake, akalongaje bila kufiha kuta, “Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta yumwe venyu akumituka” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Vadahitswa vake vakilolaje, kwasawuli sivakatselaga kuta angumulonga nani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mudahitswa yumwe yo avaga aganitwe ndalahela, avaga ichite habehi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petulo akamuditilaje ndajilo yula mudahitswa kuta umuputse Mutwa, “Mbe, angumulonga nani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Yula mudahitswa kuno amwegamilye Yesu mumambaga akamuputsaje kuta, “Mutwa utulonjele uyo nani yo akukupituka?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, “Yula yo ngumupela chipande chino cha libumunda ho nguva ntsichitsangitse mubakuli.” Ihyo hoavaga kuchitsangitsa chipande chila cha libumunda mubakuli, akamupelaje Yuda mwana va Simoni Isikaliyote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Luvala lulo Yuda hoavaga kwanuchila chipande chila cha libumunda, Lihoka likamwinjilaje. Yesu akamulonjelaje Yuda, “Lulongwa lo un'gana kudita wangufitse kuludita.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Vala veka wovavaga vikalise hala hachilyo kuduhu nambe yumwe yo atselaga kuta Yesu amulonje hila Yuda kwasawuli ya chichi. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwasawuli Yuda avikaga magobole, vanji vahotsaga kuta Yesu avaga amulonje akagule finu fyo fin'ganika kwasawuli ya Liwungo, awu kuvapela vagayu finu. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Luvala lula Yuda hoavaga kwanuchila libumunda lila, akangufitsaje kuhuma kivala. Nako kwavaga hachilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ntsipya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Hala Yuda hoavaga kubita kivala, Yesu akalongaje, lelo atsumitswe Mwana va Munu, nayo Mulungu atsumitswe mugati mwake. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Manyi Mulungu ave atsumitswe mugati mwa Mwana, nayo Mulungu akuwulajila wutsumitso wa Mwana mugati mwake mwene, nayo akumutsumitsa simusika. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Henye vanangu, heni ntsing'acha ntsili hamwe na henye kwa luvala ludodo hela. Mukusaka na kota hila fyo ntsavalonje Vayawudi, na hihyo sambi ntsinlonga na henye kuta kula kontsim'bita heni henye simukuvetsa kutsa! <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ntsinguvapelani amuli ntsipya mwigane henye kwa henye. Kota heni fyo ntsivaganite henye, henye nanye mwiganaje henye kwa henye. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Manyi mwigane, vanu veka vakutsela kuta henye muli vadahitswa vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga ndongwa tsa kulutalo hila Petulo fyo akumukana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lukasi 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petulo akamuputsaje Yesu, “Mutwa um'bita kwiya?” Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, “Kontsim'bita heni siufuluche ufwate sambi, lechelelo ukufwata hambele.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petulo akawilaje kumuputsa, “Mutwa, kwasawuli yachi ngulemwa kukufwata sambi? Heni ntsili chang'ani kufwa kwasawuli ya heve!” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu akamujibulaje, “Nachene uli chang'ani kufwa kwasawuli ya heni? Ntsingukulonjela wukweli kuta, hala ntsogolo huyikuva siyilavika kadatu ukuva ung'anile!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu yo ng'asi ya kubita kwa Dada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mulekaje kususutala munumbula tsenyu.” Mungumutumba Mulungu, na kaha munumbe na heni. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mu nyumba ya Dada vangu muna hono holofu ha kikala, manyi si ihyo ntsika kuvalonjela. Heni ntsimbita kuvavichila chang'ani hono ha kikala. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Heni manyi mbite na kuvavichila chang'ani henye hono ha kikala, nguwuya kaha na kuvategula mwikale hamwe na heni, ili hono hala hontsili heni na henye muve baho. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Henye mun'tsela hila fyo mukubita kula ko ntsim'bita.<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi akamulonjelaje, “Mutwa, hetwe situkutsele ko um'bita, ihyo tukuyitsela ndawuli ng'asi?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu akamujibulaje, “Heni mwene yo ng'asi, ntsinguvalonjela vanu wukweli wa Mulungu, na kuvapela wumi wo wugaya wudugo. Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche atse kwa Dada bila kukolela kwa heni. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Mukamuve muntsele heni, na kaha mukakumutsela na Dada, na kuhuma sambi mungumutsela Dada vangu, na kaha mumuwene.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Fwilipo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mutwa, utulajile Dada vako na hetwe tusichimale.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, Fwilipo ntsichite hamwe na henye luvala luno lweka nambe untsele? Munu yoyuve yo ambwene heni, amuwene Dada. Unlonga ndawuli kuta, utulajile Dada? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Mbe, nambe witumbe lwakuta heni ntsili mugati mwa Dada, nayo Dada alimugati mwa heni? Ndongwa tso ntsinguvalonjela henye, sintsinlonga kwasawuli ya heni, ila Dada yo alimugati mwangu yo ankola katsi tsake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Munumbile heni kuta ntsili mugati mwa Dada nayo Dada alimugati mwangu. Manyi siyo ihyo munumbe kwasawuli ya tsila katsi tso ntsin'dita. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, munu yoyuve yo an'numba heni, katsi tsontsin'dita heni na mwene akutsidita, ena na tsive ngomi kulutila itso akutsidita, kwasawuli heni ntsim'bita kwa Dada. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Nanye manyi musuche chinu chochive kota fyo ntsin'gana heni, icho nguchidita, ili Dada atsumitswe mugati mwa Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Nanye manyi musuche chinu chochive kota fyo ntsin'gana heni, icho nguvaditila.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga kuta akumuleta Muhe va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Manyi mungane mukutsidita amuli tsangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Naheni ngumusuka Dada vangu, nayo akuvapela Mutantsi yunji yo akikala na henye siku tseka bila wudugo. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Uyo yo Muhe va wukweli. Vanu va mu inyi tseka sivafuluche vamwanuchile kwasawuli sinambe vamuwone na sivamutsele. Lechelelo henye mumutsele kwasawuli alihamwe na henye, nayo angikala mugati mwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Singuvaleka henye muve vachiva, nguwuya kaha kikala na henye. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Lung'ali luvala ludodo hela vanu va inyi sivakumbona kaha, lechelelo henye mukumbona, kwasawuli heni nguva mumi kaha, na henye mukuva na wumi wa kweli. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Siku yila hoyikuva kufika mukutsela kuta heni ntsili mugati mwa Dada, na henye muli mugati mwangu, na heni ntsili mugati mwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Vene wo vakugadichila malajitso gangu na kugadita, iwo wo van'ngana heni, nawo wo van'ngana heni vakuganwa na Dada vangu, na heni nguvagana na ngilajila kwa vene.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ihyo Yuda, siyo yula Yuda Isikaliyote yo amupituche Yesu, akamuputsaje Yesu kuta, “Mutwa, yiveye ndawuli heve un'gana kilajila kwa hetwe, na siyo kwa vanu va inyi?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu akamupitulaje, vanu wo vakungana heni na kudita cho ntsinguvalonjela, vakutsidita ndongwa tsangu na Dada akuvagana, na heni na Dada vangu tukutsa kwawo na kikala hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Munu yoyuve yosinambe angane heni, uyo yo sinambe adite chila chontsinlonga, na ndongwa tso ntsinguvapela siyo wangu, ila wunhuma kwa Dada yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Ntsivadahitse ndongwa tsino hontsing'acha kuwuka. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Lechelelo uyo Mutantsi, yo Muhe va Mulungu, yo Dada vangu akumutuma kwenyu kukola katsi badili ya heni, akuvadahitsa ndongwa tseka na kuviwusa ndongwa tseka tsontsavalonje.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Ntsinguvalechela wusichimafu, eena wusichimafu wangu ntsinguvapela, wusichimafu wo ntsinguvapela si wunakota wula wo wutawulwaga na vanu va muinyi. Mulekaje kususutala munumbula tsenyu, na kaha mulekaje kuva na muloto. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mwahuliche ntsavalonje kuta, heni ntsim'bita na kaha nguwuya kwenyu. Manyi kweli mukanganaga muka kuhechelela kuhulika kuta ntsim'bita kwa Dada, kwasawuli mwene yo muvina kulutila heni. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Ntsivalonje ndongwa tsino ho tsing'acha kuhumila, ili ho tsikuhumila muve na litumbilo. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Singulonga hilo na henye ndongwa ntsolofu, kwasawuli mutavala va inyi iyi ankutsa, na avaje ihyo kwa heni si akuvetsa chinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Lechelelo vanu va inyi tseka van'ganika vatsele kuta ntsingumugana Dada, na heni ntsin'dita hila kota Dada fyo an'ndajitsa, “Ale mwinuche tubite!”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu yo mutsabibu gwa kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Ihyo Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake kuta, heni yo mutsabibu gwa kweli, na Dada vangu yo mulimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Chila litambi mugati mwangu lyo sinambe lilele mibawo, Dada vangu alidumulaga, na lila litambi lyolilelaga mibawo alihenjelaga, ili lilutitse kulela mibawo. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Henye mwanga mwetsile munumbula tsenyu, kwasawuli ya tsila ndongwa tso ntsivadahitse. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mwikalaje mugati mwangu, kota hila na heni fyo ntsingikala mugati mwenyu. Kota hila litambi lya mutsabibu manyi sililihamwe na lisina fyo silifuluche lilele mibawo, ho hihyo na henye simufuluche mudite kota fyo an'gana Mulungu manyi simukikala mugati mwangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Heni yo ntsili ugo mutsabibu, na henye yo muli mitambi. Vala wo vangikala mugati mwangu iwo vakudita ndongwa nofu ntsolofu, na heni mugati mwawo, iwo vakulela mibawo myolofu, kwasawuli bila heni henye simukuvetsa kudita ndongwa ntsolofu tso an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Munu yoyuve yo siakikala mugati mwangu, atagwaga kivala na kukala kota litambi. Vanu vakungasaga mitambi ijo na kujitotsa mumoto ili jipye. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Manyi mwikale mugati mwangu na ndongwa tsangu tsikale mugati mwenyu, musuche chochive cho mun'gana na henye mukuditilwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ihyo Dada vangu apataga wutsumitso hila henye homukuva mun'dita ndongwa tsangu ntsolofu, kwasawuli ya ihyo henye mukuva vadahitswa vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Kota hila Dada fyo anganile heni, ho hihyo na heni fyo ntsinguvagana henye, nanye mwikalaje muwugano wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Manyi mugadite malajitso gangu, mukikala muwugano wangu, kota hila heni fyo ntsin'dita malajitso ga Dada vangu na kikala muwugano wake. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Ntsivalonje ndongwa itsi ili muve na wuhechelelo kota wontsinawo heni, na wuhechelelo wenyu wukwile. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Iyino yo amuli yangu kuta, mwiganaje kota heni fyo ntsivaganile henye. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Kuduhu munu munya wugano wukomi kota wuno, wa munu kuwutawula wumi wake kwasawuli ya vayage. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Henye mukuva vayangu manyi mudite hila fyo ntsivalonje. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Henye singuvachema kaha vatantsi, kwasawuli mutantsi si achitsele cho an'dita muvina vake. Lechelelo heni ntsivachemile henye mu vayangu, kwasawuli ntsivagubulye ndongwa tseka tso nyuliche kuhuma kwa Dada. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Siyo henye yo mwanyagwe heni, ila heni yo ntsavahagwe henye, ngavalajitsaje mubite mukadite katsi kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu, na katsi tso mun'dita tsikale siku tseka, ili chochive cho mukumusuka Dada vangu avapele kota fyo ntsin'gana heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Amuli yangu yo iyi, mwigane henye kwa henye.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va Inyi vakuvavipila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Manyi vanu va inyi vavavipile henye, mutselaje kuta mwanga valongwe kumbipila heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Mukamuve vanu va mu inyi, inyi yika kuvagana kota hila fyo yivaganaga vanu vake. Lechelelo kwasawuli henye simuli vanu va mu inyi, ila heni ntsavahagwe henye kuhuma mu inyi, icho cho chambutso cha vanu va inyi kuvavipila. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mwiwukaje ndongwa tso ntsavalonje hamutalo kuta, mutantsi siafuluche amulutile muvina vake. Manyi yive vang'odite heni, vakuvakoda na henye, manyi vibite lulogwa lwangu, vakudita na lulongwa lwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Vakuvaditila ndongwa itso tseka kwasawuli henye muli vatantsi vangu, na kwakuva sivamutsele mwene yo anumile. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Manyi ntsikantsive sintsatsitse na kuvalonjela ndongwa tsa Mulungu, vakakuva valihela ndongwa ntsibi, lelo sivakuva na cha kipamanila kwasawuli ya itso ndongwa tsawo ntsibi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Munu yo am'mbipila heni, angumuvipila na Dada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Manyi ntsikantsive sintsadisile katsi hagati hawo tso sadisile munu yoyuve vakakuva valihela nongwa, ino lelo vambwene heni hontsin'dita ndongwa itso, vambipye heni na Dada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Lechelelo ndongwa itso tsihumye ili lukwile lulongwa lo lwandikwe mu malajitso ga Musa kuta, vambipye bule hela!<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Lechelelo iho hoakuva kutsa uyo Mutantsi yo ngumutuma kwenyu kuhuma kwa Dada vangu, uyo yo Muhe va Mulungu, akuwugubula wukweli kuhuma kwa Dada, mwene nayo akuvalonjela ndongwa tseka tsa heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Henye nanye mukuvalonjela vanu ndongwa tsangu, kwasawuli mwavaga na heni kuhuma halutalo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Ntsinguvalonjela ndongwa tsino ili mwikangatse muleche kumukana Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Vanu vakuvavinga mu nyumba ntsa kitang'anila Vayawudi. Kaha kuna luvala lukutsa hoihyo chila yo akuvawulaga henye akutijila ankola katsi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Vakuvaditila ndongwa itso kwasawuli sivamutsele Dada wala sivantsele heni. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Lelo ntsinguvalonjela henye ndongwa itsi, ili luvala holukuva kufika mwiwuche kuta ntsali ntsivalonje.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Katsi ya Muhe va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Sintsavalonje ndongwa itsi kuhuma hamutalo kwasawuli ntsali hamwe na henye. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />“Lelo heni sogwe kwa mwene yo anumile, lechelelo kuduhu nambe yo amutsitse, usogwe kwiya? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ntsivalonje ndongwa tsino, natso numbula tsenyu tsiveye na wususutalo. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjela wukweli, chiba heni mbuche, kwasawuli manyi heni ndeche kuwuka Mutantsi siakutsa kwenyu. Lechelelo manyi heni mbuche, iho ho ngumutuma kwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nayo uyo Mutantsi ho akuva kutsa, akuvalajila vanu va inyi tseka kuta van'dita ndongwa ntsibi, na hila vanu fyo vakidichilwa na Mulungu, na hila vanu fyo vakuhingwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Vadisile ndongwa ntsibi kwasawuli sinambe vanumbile heni. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Muhe va Mulungu akuvalajila hila heni fyo ndichilwe na Mulungu, kwasawuli heni sogwe kwa Dada na henye simukumbona kaha. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Kwasawuli ya wuhigo, kuta Lihoka livina lya inyi tseka mwanga lihijitwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Kaha ntsinatso ndongwa ntsolofu ntsa kuvalonjela, ila kwasawuli sambi simukuvetsa kikangatsa. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Hoakuva kutsa uyo Muhe va Mulungu yo agubulaga wukweli akuvalongotsa ku wukweli weka, kwasawuli siakulonga kwa kugana mwene, kwasawuli akulonga ndongwa tso ahuliche, na akuvalonjela ndongwa tsa kulutalo. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Mwene uyo akuntsumitsa heni, kwasawuli akutegula ndongwa tsangu na kuvalonjela henye. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Finu fyeka fyo anafyo Dada fyo fyangu. Icho cho chambutso cha heni kuvalonjela kuta Muhe va Mulungu akutegula ndongwa tsangu na kuvalonjela henye.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Susuto yikugaluka kuva wuhechelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Lusije luvala ludodo henye simukumbona kaha, lechelelo kaha luvala ludodo hambele mukumbona kaha!” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ihyo vadahitswa vake vatunga vakiputsaje, “Anamana yachi ho angutulonjela kuta, lusije luvala ludodo henye simukumbona, na luvala ludodo hambele henye mukumbona kaha? Kaha anlonga kwasawuli heni sogwe kwa Dada.” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Vakendelelaje kiputsa kuta, “Anamana yachi kulonga, lusije luvala ludodo? Sinambe twelewe choanlonga.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu akantselage kuva vaganaga kumupuntsa, duve akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, mungiputsa fyo ndontsile, lusije luvala ludodo nanye simukumbona, na kaha lusije luvala ludodo hambele mukumbona kaha? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta, henye mukuvemba na kukalala, lechelelo vanu va inyi vakuhechelela, kukalala kwenyu kukugaluka kuva wuhechelelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Luvala lwa mudala kulela mwana manyi luve habehi awonaga wuvafi kwasawuli luvala lwa kulela luvaga lufisile, lechelelo manyi mwanga ave aletsile mwana wuvafi wula wugalukaga kuva wuhechelelo kwasawuli amuletite mwana muinyi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Henye sambi mun'wona wuvafi, lechelelo hongutsa kaha henye mukuva na wuhechelelo munumbula tsenyu, na wuhechelelo uwo kuduhu munu siakuvetsa kuwuhetsa. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Siku iyo simukusuka chinu chochive. Ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta chinu chochive cho mukusuka kwa Dada vangu kota fyo ntsin'gana heni, nayo akuvapela. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Nambe sambi mung'acha kusuka chinu chochive kwa mamulaka gangu. Musuche nanye mukupelwa ili wuhechelelo wenyu wukwile.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutsisuma katsi ntsibi tsa muinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Ntsivalonje ndongwa tsino kwa sembeletso. Lelo kuna luvala lunkutsa lo nguvalonjela bila sembeletso, ila nguvalonjela ndongwa tsa Dada vangu bila sembeletso. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Siku iyo mukusuka kota litumbilo lyenyu fyolili kwa heni, na sinambe ntsivalonjele kuta heni nguvasuchila kwa Dada, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwasawuli mwene Dada avaganite henye kwakuva munganite na munumbye kuta heni ntsahumye kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Heni ntsahumye kwa Dada ngatsaje muinyi, lelo ntsinguyileka inyi na kupiluka kwa Dada.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ihyo vadahitswa vake vakalongaje, ena! Lelo unlonga bila sembeletso yoyive. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Lelo tutselye kuta heve un'tsela chila chinu, siun'ganika kuputswa lulongwa loluve. Kwasawuli ya lulogwa ulu, lelo tungukutumba kuta wahumye kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu akavapitulaje kuta, “Mbe, lelo mun'numbila? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Luvala lunkutsa, kaha mwanga lufisile, lwa henye nyeka mukupwiling'ana chila munu akubita kukaye kwake, na heni mukundeka ntsiyena, lechelelo heni sintsiyena ndaya, kwakuva Dada vangu alihamwe na heni. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ntsivalonje ndongwa itsi ili muve na wusichimafu kwa kihantsa na heni. Mukukodeka mu inyi, lechelelo mwikangatsaje numbula tsenyu! Heni mwanga ntsitsisumile katsi ntsibi tsa muinyi!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvasuchila vadahitswa vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso, akagalamilaje Kilanga kwa Mulungu na kulonga kuta, Dada luvala mwanga lufisile. Umutsumitse mwanago ili mwanago nayo akutsumitse. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwasawuli wamupelye mwanago mamulaka kwa vanu veka, ili avepele wumi wo wugaya wudugo, vala veka wo umupelye. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Wumi wo wugaya wudugo wo uwu, vakutsele heve va wiyena Mulungu va wukweli, na vamutsele Yesu Chilisito yo wamutumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Heni ngutsumitse heve muinyi kwa kukwitsa katsi yila yowamelye ntsiyidite. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Lelo Dada untumitse halutalo hako kwa wula wumelemo wontsali nawo hamwe na heve hoyavaga inyi ying'acha kuwumbwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Ngudisile utambulwe kwa vanu vala wo wamelye kuhuma ku inyi. Vavaga vanu vako nave ukamelaje vave vangu, nawo vatsidiche ndongwa tsako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Lelo sambi vangulukagula kuta fyeka fyo wamelye fyahumye kwako. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Heni ntsavadahitse ndongwa tsila tso wamelye, nawo vatsanuche na vakalukagulaje nachene kuta heni ntsahumye kwa heve, na kaha vitumbye kuta heve yo wanumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Ntsinguvasuchila iwo, nambe ntsivasuchile vanu va inyi tseka, ila ntsiguvasuchila vala ng'ani yo wamelye kwasawuli iva wo vako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Vanu vangu veka wo vako, na vanu vako veka wo vangu, na wuvina wangu wugubulwe mugati mwa vanu iwo wo umelye. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Lelo heni ntsin'wuka muinyi na ntsinkutsa kwa heve, lechelelo vene vang'acha vali muinyi. Dada va wiyeka, dedede ntsinsuka uvadite vave kota heve fyo uli, na kaha vave na wumwe kota hetwe fyotuli na wumwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Hontsavaga nawo heni, ntsavimililaga na kuvavika vikale finofu kota fyo un'gana heve. Heni ntsavimilye na kuduhu nambe yumwe yo ayatsile ila yula yo aganikaga kuyaga, ili Mandiko gako gakwile. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Lechelelo ntsinkutsa kwa heve, heni ntsavalonje ndongwa itso luvala hontsavaga ntsing'acha ntsing'ali muinyi, ili vave na wuhechelelo wangu wowukwilye mugati mwawo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ntsivapelye lulogwa lwako, nawo vanu va muinyi vavavipye kwasawuli vene siyo va muinyi, kota hila heni si ntsili va muinyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Sintsinsuka kuta uvahetse muinyi, ila ntsinsuka uvamile na lila Linya wubi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Vene siyo va muinyi yino, kota heni fyo sintsiva muinyi yino. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Uvadite chang'ani ili vave vako, kwasawuli lulongwa lwako lwa wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kota hila fyo wanumile heni muinyi, na heni ntsinguvatuma vene muinyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Ntsingitawula ntsimwene kwa heve, ili nawo vapate fwayida. Vaditwe vave vako kwa wula wukweli wako.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Sintsinguvasuchila vene ng'ani, ila ntsinguvasuchila na vala veka wo vakunumba kwa kuluhulika lulogwa lwawo, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />ili vave vamwe kota hila heve Dada fyo uli mugati mwangu na heni fyontsili mugati mwako, nawo vave mugati mwetu, ili inyi yidahe na kitumba kuta heve yo wanumile heni. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Wutsumitso wula wo wamelye na heni ntsivapelye vene, ili vave vamwe kota hetwe fyo tuli vamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Heni ngikala mugati mwawo na heve ukikala mugati mwangu, ili vave vakwitswe nachene kwa kuva vamwe, ili vanu va inyi vatsele kuta heve wanumile heni, kaha unguvagana vene kota fyo ukanganile heni.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Dada! Vanu veka wo umelye heni ntsin'gana vave hamwe na heni hono hala hontsili, ili vavetse kuwuwona wuvina wangu wo wamelye, kwasawuli wanganile hala ho ying'acha kuwumbwa inyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Bee, Dada yo uditaga ndongwa tsa wuwuya luvala lweka! Vanu va muinyi sivakutsele, lechelelo heni ngutsele nawo vatselye kuta heve yo wanumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Heni ntsavadisile vakutsele heve, na kaha ngwendelela kuvadita vakutsele, ili wugano wula wo wanganile heni wuve mugati mwawo, na heni ntsive mugati mwawo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angibatika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lukasi 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu aveye kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso, ho akawukaje na vadahitswa vake na kulowoka kubita kumwambu kwa kalenga ka Cheduloni. Kuko kwavaga na chinyungu cha mibichi ja mitseyituni, ihyo mwene na vadahitswa vake vakinjilaje umo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, yo amupituche Yesu ahakagulaga hono iho kwakuva mala ntsongofu Yesu abitaga hono iho na vadahitswa vake. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Ihyo Yuda akatsaje kuchinyungu kuno anguchilongotsa chipinga cha vimilitsi va chi Lumi na vatantsi vamwe va Vatawula nambiko vavina hamwe na Mafwalisayo, nawo vavaga vategwe tala, na solola na fifwimilo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Nayo Yesu kuno antsela fyeka fyo fikumupata, akahumilaje na kuvaputsa, “Mungumusaka nani?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nawo vakamupitulaje kuta, “Yesu va ku Natsaleti!” Yesu akatyaje, “Yo heni!” Yuda yula munyakumupituka nayo avaga imile hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu aveye kuvalonjela, “Yo heni!” Vakapilukaje chimbelembele na kugwa hanyi! <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu akavaputsaje kaha, “Mungumusaka nani?” Nawo vakamupitulaje kuta, “Yesu va ku Natsaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kuta, “Mwanga ntsivalonje yo heni. Manyi muve munsaka heni muvaleche iva vawuche.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Alontsile ndongwa itso ili lukwile lulongwa lula loavaga alontsile kuta, “Sintsamuyatsitse nambe yumwe va vala wo wamelye.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Ihyo Simoni yo Yesu amuchemye litawa lya Petulo avaga na waladi, akawusomolaje mu yala na kumudumula mutantsi va Muvina va Vatawula nambiko lipilichilo lya lubali lwa liwoko lililo. Mutantsi uyo achemwaga Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu akamulonjelaje Petulo, “Pilule waladi wako mu yala yake. Mbe, heve un'gana ndeche kukolela ng'odeko tso n'gana Dada vangu ng'olele?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ansindikwa kwa Muvina va Vatawula nambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ihyo lila lilugu lya vimilitsi va chi Lumi hamwe na muvina vawo, na vala vimilitsi va Nyumba ya Mulungu vakamubataje Yesu na kumuwopa ndejesi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />nawo vakamusindikaje kwa Anasi, nayo Anasi yo mwanage avaga atoliche kwa Kayafwa, nayo Kayafwa avaga Muvina va Vatawula nambiko mwaka ugo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Uyo Kayafwa yo yula yo avaga avalonje Vayawudi kuta chiba munu yumwe afwe kwasawuli ya vanu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo angumukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69">Matayo 26:69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Lukasi 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petulo hamwe na mudahitswa yunji vakamufwataje Yesu. Nayo yula mudahitswa yunji atselanikaga na Muvina va Vatawula nambiko, ihyo akinjilaje hamwe na Yesu mu lidama lya nyumba yila ya Muvina va Vatawula nambiko. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Lechelelo Petulo avaga imile hivala habehi na lwitsi lukomi lwa kwinjilila hono iho. Duve uyo mudahitswa yunji yo avaga antselanika na Muvina va Vatawula nambiko akahumaje hivala akalongaje na mudala yo imililaga ha lwitsi ulo lukomi lwa kwinjilila, uyo mwimilitsi akamulekaje Petulo injile mugati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Yula mudala akamuwutsaje Petulo, “Mbe, heve nave si uli yumwe va vadahitswa vake munu yuno?” Petulo akakanaje kuta, “Ndaya! Siyo heni!” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Vatantsi na vimilitsi vavaga vakotsitse moto gwa mukala kwasawuli kwavaga na ng'ala, nawo vavaga vakota moto. Nayo Petulo avaga imile hamwe nawo kuno ankota moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvina va Vatawula nambiko angumuputsa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Lukasi 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Luvala lula hotsahumilaga ndongwa itso, yula Muvina va Vatawula nambiko avaga angumuputsa Yesu kwasawuli ya vadahitswa vake na madahitso gake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, ntsavaga ntsilonga halutalo ha vanu. Siku tseka bila kifiha ntsavaga ntsinguvadahitsa vanu mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi na ku Nyumba ya Mulungu mo vitang'anilaga Vayawudi. Sintsalontsile lulongwa loluve kwa kifiha. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kwasawuli yachi um'mbutsa heni? Uvaputse vanu yo vahulikaga ndongwa tsila tso ntsavalonjelaga. Vene van'tsela tso ntsavalonjelaga. <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso, mwimilitsi yumwe va Nyumba ya Mulungu yo avaga imile habehi nayo, akamutovaje Yesu kofi kumiho na kumulonjela kuta, “Mbe, ihyo fyo yin'ganika kumupitula Muvina va Vatawula nambiko? <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, manyi ntsive ndontsile chinu chibi duve ulonje wubi wondontsile. Lelo manyi ntsive ndontsile wukweli un'novela chinu chachi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ihyo Yesu kuno awopitwe ndejesi, Anasi akamusindikaje kwa Kayafwa, yo avaga Muvina va Vatawula nambiko.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo angumukana kaha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Lukasi 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Luvala ulo Petulo avaga imile hono iho an'kota moto. Duve vanu vakamuputsaje, “Mbe, heve siyo yumwe va vala vadahitswa vake ndaa?” Petulo akakanaje kuta, “Siyo heni!” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumwe va vapogotsi va Muvina va Vatawula nambiko, yo avaga mung'olotse na yula munu yo amuhutwe lipilichilo na Petulo, akamupitulaje kuta, “Mbe, heni sintsakuwene kula ku chinyungu ulihamwe nayo munu yuno?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petulo akakanaje kaha kuta, luvala lulo ntsogolo yikavikaje.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ansindikwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matayo 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lukasi 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Hoyavaga kufika hamilawu milawu vavina va Vayawudi vakamutegulaje Yesu kuhuma kwa Kayafwa na kumusindika ku nyumba ya chintsajila ya Chilumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyumba iyi ya chintsajila yachemwaga Pulayitoliyo</char></note>. Lechelelo vene sivinje mugati umo, kwasawuli vaganaga kivika chang'ani halutalo ha Mulungu kwasawuli ya Liwungo lya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Hoihyo Pilato akahumaje kivala na kuvaputsa, “Mbe, mungumuhijila chichi munu yuno?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Vene vakatyaje, “Manyi munu yuno aka ave siadisile lulongwa lubi, situkakumuleta kwa heve.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato akavalonjelaje, “Duve mumutegule henye mukamuhije kwa malajitso genyu.” Vayawudi vakamupitulaje kuta, “Hetwe tulihela mamulaka ga kumukopola munu yoyuve.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Valontsile ndongwa itso ili lukwile lulongwa lula loavaga alontsile Yesu kulajila chifo chake cho akufwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Ihyo Pilato akinjilaje munyumba yake ya chintsajila na akalajitsaje vamulete Yesu mugati, akamuputsaje kuta, “Heve yo Muntsajila va Vayawudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, “Mbe, un'wutsa kwa mahotso gako, awu kuna munu yo akulonje ndongwa tsa heni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato akamupitulaje kuta, mbe, unhotsa kuta heni tsili Muyawudi? Vanu va inyi yako, na Vavina va Vatawula nambiko, iwo wo vakuletite kwa heni. Mbe, wanantsile chinu chachi?<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, “Wuntsajila wangu siyo wa inyi yino, manyi yikayive wuntsajila wangu wa inyi yino, vatantsi vangu vakakumamanila ili ndeche kibatika na vavina va Vayawudi. Lechelelo wuntsajila wangu siyo wa hano.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato akamuputsaje kuta, “Ino heve uli muntsajila?” Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, “Heve ulontsile, kuta heni ntsili muntsanjila. Heni ntsaleliche kwasawuli iyi, na kwasawuli iyi ntsatsitse muinyi kuvalonjela vanu wukweli. Chila munu yo anguwufwata wukweli anyulikaga heni.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato akamuputsaje Yesu kuta, “Wukweli cho chinu chachi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu anhigwa kufwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lukasi 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato hoavaga kulonga ndongwa itso akabitaje kaha kula kivala kovali Vayawudi na kuvalonjela, “Heni sintsiluwene lubi loluve lo adisile munu yuno. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Lechelelo henye muna ntsovelo yenyu kuta luvala lwa Pasaka ntsin'ganika ntsimulechele muwopwa yumwe yo mungumugana. Mbe, mun'gana ntsimudindulile uyu Muntsajila va Vayawudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Ihyo vene vakayovaje, “Ndaya, siyo yuno, ila mulechele Balaba!” Nayo uyo Balaba avaga muwumiyani.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ihyo Pilato akalajitsaje vamutegule Yesu atowe mikotya. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Vala vimilitsi vakabotaje ng'ata ya mifwa vakamufwalitsaje Yesu kumutwi. Vakamufwalisaje na kantsu ya chitsajila ya lanji ya tsambalawu. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Vakavaje vankwina halutalo hoavaga mu nyumba ya chintsajila kuno vanlonga, “Kamwene bee, Muntsajila va Vayawudi!” Kuno vangumutova makofi. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato akahumaje kivala kaha na kuvalonjela kuta mulole, ntsinguvaletela kivala, mulukagule kuta heni sintsiluwene lulongwa lubi loluve lo adisile. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Ihyo, Yesu akahumaje kivala kuno vamufwisile ng'ata ya mifwa na yila kantsu ya chintsajila yinya lanji ya tsambalawu. Pilato akavalonjelaje, “Mumulave! Munu venyu uyu hano.” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Vala Vavina va Vatawula nambiko na vimilitsi va Nyumba ya Mulungu vavaga kumuwona vakalongaje fikami kuta, “Muvambe! Muvambe!” Pilato akavalonjelaje, Mumutegule henye muvene mukamuvambe mu musalaba, kwasawuli heni sintsiluwene lulongwa lubi loluve lwa kumuhijila. <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Vayawudi vakamupitulaje kuta, “Hetwe tunayo seliya, na kwa seliya iyo an'ganika akopolwe, kwasawuli idutsitse kuta mwene yo Mwana va Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato hoavaga kuhulika ihyo akavaje na muloto ndalahela. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Pilato akamutegulaje kaha Yesu akinjilaje nayo mu nyumba yila na kumuputsa kuta, “Heve uhumye kwiya?” Lechelelo Yesu siamupitwe chinu chochive. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato akamulonjelaje kuta heve ulema kulonga na heni? Sinambeutsele kuta heni ntsina mamulaka ga kukulechela awu kukuvamba. <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, “Heve siukakuva na mamulaka gogave kwa heni manyi uka uve siulapelwa kuhuma Kilanga kwa Mulungu. Ihyo yula yo andetite kwa heve, uyo yo akuva na nongwa ngomi ndalahela.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kuhuma luvala ulo Pilato akasakaje hila fyo akumudindulila Yesu, lechelelo Vayawudi vakavaje van'yova kuta, manyi umulechele munu uyo, heve siukuva muyage na Kayisali! Chila munu yo alongaga kuta mwene yo muntsajila amupitukaga Kayisali. <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Duve Pilato hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso akamuletaje kaha Yesu kivala na kikala muchigoda cha wuhigo, hono hohanchemwa, “Luga lwa maganga.” Kwa Chiyebulaniya hachemwaga, “Gabatsa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Yavaga saa sita ya hamunyi ya siku ya kivika chang'ani kwasawuli ya Pasaka. Pilato akavalonjelaje Vayawudi, “Muntsajila venyu yuno hano!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Vene vakatovaje chiyove kuta, “Muhetse! Muhetse! Muvambe mu musalaba!” Pilato akavaputsaje, “Mbe, ntsimuvambe muntsanjila venyu?” Vala Vavina va Vatawula nambiko vakalongaje, “Hetwe tulihela muntsajila yunji ila Kayisali ng'ani.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Kaha Pilato akamutawulaje Yesu ili vamuvambe mu musalaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu anvambwa mu musalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lukasi 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ihyo, vakamutegulaje Yesu ili vabite vakamuvambe mu musalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu akahumaje kuno itegulye musalaba gwake na kubita hono ho hachemwaga “Gubang'a gwa mutwi.” Kwa Chiyebulaniya hachemwaga, “Goligota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ihyo kuko vakamuvambaje mu musalaba. Vamuvambite hamwe na vanu vavili, yumwe musalaba gwake gwavaga lubali lwa kwichiji na yunji musalaba gwake gwavaga lubali lwa kwililo lwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato akandikaje mukabawo na kukavika hachanya ha musalaba gwa Yesu kokali kandikwe hino, “Yesu va ku Natsaleti, Muntsajila va Vayawudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Vanu wolofu vasomile, kwasawuli hono iho ho avambitwe havaga habehi na muji, iko kabawo kavaga kandikwe kwa Chiyebulaniya, na Chilatini, na Chijilichi. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Vavina va Vatawula nambiko na Vayawudi vakamulonjela Pitato, uleche kwandika, Muntsajila va Vayawudi, ila wandiche kuta, “Munu yula yo alongaga kuta, mwene yo muntsajila va Vayawudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato akavapitulaje kuta, “Chotsandiche icho mwanga tsandiche!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Vimilitsi hovavaga kusinda kumuvamba Yesu, vakategulaje myenda jake, vakagavasaje filundo fitayi, chilundo chimwe kwa chila mwimilitsi. Vakategulaje kaha na kantsu yake, kantsu iyo yavaga siyilahonwa, ila yavaga yifumilwe kuhuma kilanga mbaka hasi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Ihyo iwo vimilitsi vakilonjelaje vene kwa vene kuta, “Tuleche kuyidemulasa lechelelo tuyitovele kula, kuta yive ya nani.” Lulongwa ulu lwahumye ili Mandiko ga Mulungu gakwile goganlonga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Vagavise myenda jangu, na mwenda gwangu vagutovye kula.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">Ihyo fyo vadisile vala vimilitsi.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Hala habehi na musalaba gwa Yesu vavaga vimile, Maliyamu yuve va Yesu, na Maliyamu muhatsa va yuve, yoali muchina va Chileyopa na Maliyamu va ku Majidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu hoavaga kumuwona yuve alihabehi na yula mudahitswa yo amuganaga, akamulonjelaje, mama! Uyo yo mwanago. <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kaha akamulonjelaje yula mudahitswa, “Yuwo uyo iho.” Kuhuma luvala ulo yula mudahitswa akamutegulaje yuve va Yesu na kubita nayo kukaye yake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankufwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lukasi 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ihyo Yesu hoavaga kutsela kuta ndongwa tseka tsikwilye, ili Mandiko ga Mulungu gakwile akalongaje kuta, “Ntsin'wona ng'alu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Hono iho havaga na lihava lyolyali limemile sichi. Ihyo vakatsabikaje lidodochi umo mu sichi na kuvika mu lusito lwa mubichi gwa hisopo, na kumuvichila ha mulomo ili anune. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu hoavaga kuyinuna iyo sichi, akalongaje, “Lulongwa lusisile!” Akahonamitsaje mutwi na kufwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwimilitsi angumuhoma Yesu mugoha mulubafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Vayawudi sivaganaga mivili jisigale mu misalaba ha Siku ya Kwesela, ino lelo kwasawuli yavaga siku ya kivika chang'ani, nayo yavaga siku ya mana kwavene, na kwasawuli siku yo yinkutsa yavaga Siku ya Kwesela na kaha yavaga siku ya Liwungo lya Pasaka. Ihyo vakamusukaje Pilato avaleche vavabene magulu, ili vafwe na mivili jihetswe mu misalaba kung'acha kung'ali. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Duve vala vimilitsi vakabitaje vakagabenaje magulu ga yula munu va kwantsa na yula va kavili yovavaga vavambitwe hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Lechelelo hovavaga kufika ha Yesu, vakawonaje mwanga afweye, ihyo vakalekaje kumubena magulu gake. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Lechelelo mwimilitsi yumwe akamuhomaje Yesu mugoha, na bahobaho yikahumaje danda na malenga <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Nayo munu yo atsiwene ndongwa itso akatulonje ili na henye mwitumbile. Ndongwa tso alontsile tsa wukweli, na mwene an'tsela kuta alongaga wukweli. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ndongwa itso tsahumye ili gakwile Mandiko ga Mulungu goganlonga kuta, “Kuduhu nambe chitseje chimwe cho chikubenwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kaha na mandiko ganji ganlonga, “Vakumulava yula yo vamuhomile na mugoha.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antsikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lukasi 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Yusufu va ku Alimataya yo avaga mudahitswa va Yesu kwa lufiho, kwasawuli ya kuwogopa Vayawudi, akamusukaje Pilato amupele muvili gwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nayo Nikodemu yula yoali ahele kwa Yesu hachilo, nayo akatsaje kuno ategwe wuhantso wa finunyililo fya manemane na wubani kota chiyasi cha chilo salasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Vakategulaje muvili gwa Yesu, vakagupilingitsaje sanda ya galama ngomi hamwe na finu fyo fyanunyililaga kota hila fyo tsili ntsovelo tsa Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Hono iho ho avambitwe Yesu hali na chinyungu, na ha chinyungu icho hali na kabuli ntsipya ying'acha kutsikwa munu yoyuve. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ihyo kwasawuli yavaga siku ya kivika chang'ani kwa Siku ya Kwesela Vayawudi, na kwasawuli kabuli iyo yavaga habehi, vakamutsikaje Yesu mumo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu an'tsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lukasi 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Hamilawu kung'acha kucha siku ya kwantsa ya wichi, Maliyamu va ku Majidala akabitaje kula kukabuli na kuliwona lila liganga lyo lyavaga mulango gwa kabuli lihetsitswe. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ihyo akabitaje luvilo kwa Simoni Petulo hamwe na yula mudahitswa yunji yo aganagwa na Yesu, na kuvalonjela kuta, “Vaguhetsitse muvili gwa Mutwa mukabuli, na sinambe tutsele kula ko vaguvisile.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petulo hamwe na yula mudahitswa yunji vakawukaje luvala lulo na kubita kula kukabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Veka vavili vavaga vam'bilima, lechelelo yula mudahitswa yunji abilime hilo kuliko Petulo, akalongolaje kufika kukabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Hoavaga kufika, akahonamaje na kuhunjilila mula mukabuli, akatsiwonaje sanda ng'ani tsivisilwe, lechelelo mwene sainje mukabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Nayo Simoni Petulo akafikaje na kwinjila mu kabuli, akatsiwonaje tsila sanda ng'ani, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na chila chitambala choali apintsilwe Yesu kumutwi chavaga chipilingine na chiliyena. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Kaha na yula mudahitswa yo avaga alongwe kufika kukabuli nayo akinjilaje mugati, akalolaje na kutumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Kwasawuli mbaka luvala ulo vavaga vang'acha kugatsela gala Mandiko ga Mulungu go galongaga kuta yin'ganika Yesu atsilipuche. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Duve vala vadahitswa vakapilukaje kukaye.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuhumila Maliyamu va ku Majidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matayo 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maliyamu va ku Majidala hoavaga imile hivala hakabuli kuno anvemba. Hoavaga anvemba akahonamaje na kuhunjilila mukabuli, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />akavawonaje vatantsi vavili va Kilanga va Mulungu wo vafwite myenda myelu, vikite hala hogwali muvili gwa Yesu, yumwe avaga kumutwi na yunji kumagulusika. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Vala vatantsi va Kilanga va Mulungu vakamuputsaje, “Yuva un'vembela chichi?” Nayo akavalonjelaje, “Vaguhetsitse muvili gwa Mutwa vangu na sinambetsele ko vaguvisile!” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akapitukaje na kumuwona Yesu imile, lechelelo siamukagwe kuta yo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu akamuputsaje, “Yuva umnvembela chinu chachi? Ungumusaka nani?” Nayo Maliyamu atyaga kuta anlongana na mutuntsaji va chinyungu, nayo Maliyamu akatyaje “Muvina manyi uve yo heve uguhetsitse, undonjele ko uguvisile mbite ngagutegule.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu akamuchemaje, “Maliyamu!” Iho Maliyamu akapitukaje nakulonga nayo kwa Chiyebulaniya, “Laboni!” Linya mana ya, “Mudahitsi!” <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Uleche kimbata, kwasawuli ntsing'acha kubita Kilanga kwa Dada. Lechelelo ubite ukavalonjele vang'olotsangu kuta, ntsim'bita Kilanga kwa Dada vangu yo Dada venyu, na kwa Mulungu vangu yo Mulungu venyu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ihyo yula Maliyamu va ku Majidala akabitaje na kuvalonjela vadahitswa va Yesu kuta, “Ntsimuwene Mutwa!” Kaha akavalonjelaje ndongwa tsila tso amulajitse Mutwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahumila Vadahitswa vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lukasi 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Hoyavaga kufika mumihe mwa siku ya kwantsa ya wichi. Vadahitswa vavaga vitang'ine hamwe mu nyumba, na ntsitsi tsali tsidinditwe kwasawuli ya kuwogopa vavina va Vayawudi, Yesu akavahumilaje na kwima hagati hawo, akavalonjelaje, “Wusichimafu wuve na henye!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akavalajilaje mawoko gake na lubafu lwake. Ihyo vala vadahitswa hovavaga kumuwona Mutwa, vakamwemwetelaje ndalahela. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kaha, “Wusichimafu wuve na henye! Kota hila Dada fyo anumile heni na heni ntsinguvatuma na henye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Nayo Yesu hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akavaputilaje muhe na kuvalonjela kuta, “Mwanuchile Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Manyi muvahulumile vanu wovave ndongwa tsawo ntsibi, iwo vakuhulumilwa na Mulungu, na manyi muleme kuvahulumila vanu wovave ndongwa tsawo ntsibi, iwo vakusigala mu ndongwa tsawo ntsibi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuhumila Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Lechelelo yumwe va vala vadahitswa kumi na vavili, Tomasi yo achemwaga kaha munya mbili, avaga alihaduhu hala Yesu hoavaga avahumye vadahitswa vake. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ihyo vala vadahitswa vanji vakamulonjelaje, “Tumuwene Mutwa!” Lechelelo Tomasi akavalonjelaje, “Manyi ndeche kutsiwona ng'ofu tsila tsa misumali mu mawoko gake, na kwambalagata kwa liwoko lyangu mu ng'ofu ya mulubafu lwake, singuhogola kutumba.” <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku nane, vadahitswa vake hovavaga valihamwe mugati munyumba, nayo Tomasi avaga alihamwe navo. Kaha Yesu akavahumilaje kuno ntsitsi tsali ntsidinditwe, na akimaje hagati hawo akatyage, “Wusichimafu wuve na henye!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kahi akamulonjelaje Tomasi, lete chala chako hano ulole mawoko gangu, golole liwoko lyako wambalagate lubafu lwangu. Un'ganika utumbile, uleche kuva na muhwehwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi akamupitulaje kuta, Mutwa vangu na Mulungu vangu! <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Mbe, unumbye kwasawuli umbwene? Vatambichilwe na Mulungu vala yo vakunumba bila kumbona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chambutso cha kwandika chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu adisile ndajilo tsinji ntsolofu halutalo ha vadahitswa vake tso sitsandikwe mu chitabu chino. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Lechelelo ndajilo tsino tsandikwe ili mutumbe kuta Yesu yo Chilisito Mwana va Mulungu, na kwakutumba uko muve na wumi wo wugaya wudugo, kwa kikala mugati mwake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahumila vadahitswa vake saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Yesu akavahumilaje vadahitswa vake halubali lwa lilamba lya Tibeliya. Avahumye chinya ihi, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petulo, na Tomasi yo achemwaga munya mbili, na Natsanaheli munyakaye va Kana ya ku Galilaya, na vana vavili va Tsebedayo na vadahitswa vanji vavili, vavaga veka hohamwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petulo akavalonjelaje vayage, “Sogwe kulopa somba.” Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Tukubitasa hamwe na heve.” Vakakwinaje mutumbwi, lechelelo hachilo icho sivapatite chinu chochive. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Hokwavaga kung'acha kutitutitu, Yesu akimaje halubali lwa lilamba, lechelelo vadahitswa vala sivamukagwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Nyee! Vakwamitsi vangu muna somba yoyive?” Vene vakamupitulaje kuta, “Ndaya! Situpasile chochive.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwise nyafu ntsenyu lubali lwa iwoko ililo lya mutumbwi na henye mukupata somba.” Duve vakisaje waafu mu lubali ulo nawo vakapataje somba ntsolofu ndalahela, mbaka vakalemwaje na kukwega mu mutumbwi gwawo. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Yula mudahitswa yo agan'waga ndalahela na Yesu akamulonjelaje Petulo kuta, “Hee! Uyo yo Mutwa!” Simoni Petulo hoavaga kuhulika ihyo, akafwalaje mwenda gwake kwasawuli avaga alihela myenda, nayo akitotsaje mu lilamba. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Lechelelo vala vadahitswa vanji yo vavaga mulubali lwa lila lilamba wutali kota hatuva mya moja, vakatsaje mu mutumbwi kuvatanga vayawo kukwega waafu wo wavaga wumemile somba. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Hovavaga kufika mulubali lwa lilamba vakaguwonaje moto gwa mukala, na muchanya mwake kwavaga na somba na libumunda. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mulete hano somba tsimwe tso mupasile.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petulo akakwinaje mutumbwi, na kukwega kivala wula waafu wowali wumemite somba ngomi mya moja hamusini na tsidatu. Nayivaje ntsavaga ntsolofu ndalahela, lechelelo waafu siwalalatuche. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mutse mulye chilyo cha hamilawu.” Kuduhu nambe yumwe yo ajetsile kumuputsa kuta, “Heve yo nani?” Kwasawuli vadahitswa veka vatselaga kuta avaga Mutwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Kaha Yesu akabitaje na kutegula libumunda na kuvapela, hohihyo akavapelaje na yila somba. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ulo lwavaga luvala lwa kadatu lwa Yesu kuvahumila vadahintswa vake kuhuma atsilipuche.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuputsa Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Hovavaga kusinda kulya, Yesu akamuputsaje Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana va Yohana! Mbe, ungana heni kulutila vayago?” Nayo akamupitulaje, “Ena, Mutwa heve ungulukagula kuta heni ntsingukugana.” Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ulise chipinga changu cha ng'olo.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Kaha akamuputsaje lwa kavili, “Simoni mwana va Yohana! Mbe, un'ngana heni kulutila vayago?” Petulo akajibulaje “Ena Mutwa heve un'tsela kuta heni ntsingukugana.” Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Wamile chipinga changu cha ng'olo.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Akamupuntsaje lwa kadatu kuta, Simoni mwana va Yohana! Mbe, ungana heni kulutila vayago? Ihyo Petulo akasusutalaje ndalahela kwasawuli ya kuputswa lwa kadatu, Simoni mwana va Yohana! Mbe, ungana heni kulutila vayago? Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, Mutwa heve un'tsela ndongwa tseka, kaha un'tsela kuta heni ntsingukugana. Yesu akamulonjelaje, ulise chipinga changu cha ng'olo. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Yesu akamulonjelaje Simoni Petulo, ntsingulonjela wukweli kuta, howavaga ung'acha mukwamitsi wavavaga utsovye kiwopa musipi na kubita kokuve ko un'gana kubita. Lechelelo hala houkuva ugogwe ukugolola mawoko gako, na munu yunji akukuwopa na kukusindika ko siun'gana kubita. <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kwa kulonga ihyo, Yesu alajilaga Petulo fyo akufwa, ili Mulungu atsumitswe. Hambele akamulonjelaje, ufwate heni!<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mudahitswa yunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petulo akapitukaje na kumuwona yula mudahitswa yo aganwaga Yesu, anguvafwata. Mudahitswa uyo yo yula yo amwegamye Yesu mu mambaga hala ho valyaga chilyo cha mumihe na kumuputsa kuta, Mutwa nani yo akukupituka? <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ihyo Petulo aveye kumuwona uyo mudahitswa, akamuputsaje Yesu, Mutwa na yuno nayo lukumuhumila lulongwa lwachi? <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu akamupitulaje kuta, manyi tsin'gana uyo ikale mbaka hongutsa heni, heve un'gana chichi? Heve ufwate heni. <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ihyo lulongwa ulo lukatagalilaje hagati ha vanu vanya litumbilo va Yesu kuta, mudahitswa yula siakufwa. Lechelelo Yesu sialontsile kuta mudahitswa uyo siakufwa, ila alontsile kuta, manyi ntsin'gana ikale mbaka hongutsa heni, heve un'gana chichi? Heve ufwate heni. <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Mudahitswa uyo yo atsiwene ndongwa tsino na kutsandika, na hetwe tungulukagula kuta wusahidi wake wa wukweli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa wudugo tsa Yohani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kuna ndongwa tsinji ntsolofu tso adisile Yesu, manyi tsika tsandikwe tseka, nambe inyi yene siyika kukwila kufivika vitabu fyeka fyo fwandikwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>